<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Ndamba Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">YOHANI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chilongu ngimu wuchiyandikiwili na Yohani</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohani</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yhn</para>
  <para style="mt2">CHILONGU CHA NYANYI CHIYANDIKIWILI NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOHANI</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGULELU</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu achi cha Chilongu cha Nyanyi yichiyandikiwili na Yohani ndi chimu gati ya fila fitabu mchechi fya Lilaghanu lya Shonu yifihimulila ngalilu ya Yesu Kilistu. Kila chitabu chimu chikukemiwa “Injili,” mana yaki “Chilongu cha Nyanyi.”</para>
  <para style="ip">Fitabu afi mchechi fyayandikiwili chipindi Yesu pasovili kala fyayandikiwili na Mateyi na Maliku na Lukasi na Yohani. Chitabu cha Chilongu cha Nyanyi achi pamongapa chayandikiwili na ndundami Yohani kucha mwaka milongu tisa naha kupita kukandila Yesu pawonikili. Hataleki chitabu chalangushili ha kucha Yohani ndi yayandikili, ila ndambu ya nyandikilu yaki yiifwana na baluwa ya 1 na 2 pamu na ya 3 ya Yohani. Vayandika vamu va dahili vadeta Yohani chipindi chila ayikaleyi mumbwani ya Ifesu, topi yikuweshikana kucha chitabu achi chiyandikiwa muifesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ndundami Yohani akuhimulila lipala hela kucha chitabu chiyilata kuvatanga vandu vajumili kucha Yesu ndi Kilistu, Mwana wa Chapanga yayikala sula ya 20:31. Kwa kujumila nahawu datupati unofu mu litawa lya mweni. Chitabu achi chayandikiwili ili vandu vonda vasomi, Vayawudi na vangajila kuva vayawudi. Chitabu achi cha Yohani kwa ndambu yiutunga chiva kafwawuti na fila fitabu fimonga fitatu fya Chilongu cha Nyanyi. Akuvilishili munu kuyandika mihilu yagolili Yesu, mweni ayandikili munu ha kwilata filangushilu fya Yesu. Wuwula wula milandu yingi mikomi yiyandikiwa ha muchitabu achi kucha wula ubatishu wa Yesu na nyeshiwu kucheja.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yifivelili amu kwa chikata:</para>
  <para style="io">Yohani akukanda Chilongu cha Nyanyi musula ya1:1-18.</para>
  <para style="io">Kandi mweni akuyandika kwilata mihilu yimonga yagolili Yesu sula ya 1:19-12:50.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambeli mweni akuhimulila findu yififumbukili mungalilu ya Yesu fimuyeghili munjifwa na kushukuka sula ya 13:1-20:31.</para>
  <para style="io">Yohani amalilili chilongu mu sula ya 21 pahimulila chila chipindi Yesu pavafumbukilili vandu chipindi pashukukili, pambeli akuhimulila natilu yaki ya kuyandika chitabu achi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Chilongu aveli mundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kufumila pakwandi kwaveli na Chilongu. Chilongu ayu aveli na Chapanga na mweni aveli Chapanga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kufumila pakwandi, Chilongu aveli na Chapanga. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Chapanga alumbili findu fyosi kupitila mweni na kwahela chindu chilumbiliwi pangajila mweni. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Chilongu ayu aveli chikandilu cha unofu na awu unofu wuva lwengi kwa vandu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lwengi lula lukung'alika mulwisa, wala lwisa luweshi ha kululimba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kwaveli mundu yumu yalayishiwili na Chapanga, litawa lyaki Yohani mbatisha. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yohani mbatisha ayisili kuvatovilela vandu milandu ya lwengi, ili vandu vosi vapikanili chilongu na kujumila. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mweni aveli lwengi ha, ila ayisili kuvatovilela vandu milandu ya lwengi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Alu lwaveli lwengi lwa nakaka, lwengi lukwisa mumlima kuvang'alishila vandu vosi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Chilongu aveli mumu mumlima na ingava Chapanga alumbili mlima kupitila mweni, lakini vandu va mlima awu vamumanyili ha. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ayisili pakayaki mweni, lakini vandu vaki vamuyangili ha. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lakini vandu vosi vamyangili na kumjumila mweni avapili uwesu wa kuva vana va Chapanga. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Vana vawonikili kwa mvili ha wala kwa utami wa mundu ha, ila kwa uwesu wa Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yula yakemiwili Chilongu kava mundu, mweni kayikala pagati ya yufwi. Na yufwi tuwuwona ukomi waki, ukomi wa Mwana wa paweka yafumili kwa Tati, kamema usangi na nakaka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yohani mbatisha atovilelili milandu ya mundu ayu. Kalandula, “Ayu ndi ying'ombaya milandu yaki, kucha, ‘Ayu dayisi kumbeli ya nenga ndi mkomi kupita nenga, kwanongwa mweni avelili chipindi nenga ngalihela kuwoneka.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kufuma muusangi yimemili, twavosi yufwi tunemiliwa usangi na usangi munu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Chapanga atugayilili Malawu kupitila Musa, lakini usangi na nakaka fyayisili kupitila Yesu Kilistu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwahela mundu yamuwonili Chapanga chipindi chochosi. Ila Mwana wa paweka yaveli Chapanga nakaka na yayikala pamu na Tati. Mweni ndi yagolili Chapanga amanyiki.</para>
  <para style="s">Milandu ya Yohani Yabatisha</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 3:1-12, Maliku 1:1-8, Lukasi 3:1-18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Awu waveli utovileli wa Yohani mbatisha kwa vakomi va Vayawudi va Yelusalemu vavalayisha vatambika vamu pamu na Valawi vayendi kwa Yohani mbatisha vakamdashi mweni kava ghani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yohani alemili ha, ila kavayangula lipala hela padeta, “Nenga Kilistu ha, yalayishiwili na Chapanga”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pambeli vamdasha, “Ponopa yuwi ghani? Yuwi kuva Eliya?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yohani kavayangula, “Nenga mweni ha.”</para>
  <para style="p">Vamdasha kandi, “Yuwi kuva yula mbuyi yulayishiwili na Chapanga yula yitumulembilela?”</para>
  <para style="p">Kavayangula, “Ng'odu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pambeli vamudasha, “Topi yuwi kuva ghani? Mweni ukuyiwombela liki umweni? Tuwombeli ili tukavawombeli vala vatulayishili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yohani kavayangula padeta fila fyawombili Isaya yaveli mbuyi wa Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Nenga lishu lya mundu likukema kucheja,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Muhololi deha ya Bambu!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Vandu vala valayishiwili na Mafwalisayu <verse number="25" style="v"/>vamudasha Yohani, “Leki yuwi kuva Kilistu ng'odu, wala Eliya, wala yula Mbuyi, nongwa liki ukubatisha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yohani mbatisha kavayangula, “Nenga ngubatisha kwa machi, lakini gati ya yumwi kawoloka mweni mungajila kumumanya. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mweni ndi yayisa kumbeli ya nenga. Nenga ngujakwa ha hata kuwopola ng'oyi sha mikobasi yaki.”<figure style="fig" desc="" file="05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="1:27">Mundu yafwalili mikobasi</figure></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Milandu yosi ayi yabwitukili aku Betaniya, kumwambu ya lweni Yoludani, pahala paghaveyi akubatisha Yohani mbatisha.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu, Mwana fungami wa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki, Yohani kamuwona Yesu akumwisila, kadeta, “Loli! Mwana fungami wa Chapanga yawusha sambi sha mlimawu! <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ayu ndi yideteyi milandu yaki padetili, ‘Mundu yayisa kumbeli ya nenga ndi mkomi kupita nenga, kwanongwa mweni avelili chipindi nenga ngalihela kuwoneka!’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ndimweni baha ngamumanyili ng'odu, ila nyisa kubatisha kwa machi ili vandu va Isilaeli vamumanyi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Pambeli Yohani mbatisha kadeta utovileli awu, “Ndimuwona Mfuki Mng'alili pasunuka kufuma kumbindi kwa Chapanga kucha njiva na kayikala kumbindi yaki. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nenga ndamumanyili ha kucha mweni ghani, ila yula yandumili kubatisha kwa machi ang'ombilili, ‘Dawumuwoni Mfuki Mng'alili akusunuka kufuma kumbindi na kutula pambindi ya mundu. Mundoyu ndi mweni yabatisha kwa Mfuki Mng'alili!’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ng'ona chindu achi,” Yohani kadeta, “na nenga nguvatovilela nakaka, kucha ayu ndi Mwana wa Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvashawula vandundami vaki va kwandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki, Yohani mbatisha aveli bahala kandi pamu na vandundami vaki vavili. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Pamuwonili Yesu papita, kadeta, “Loli! Mwana fungami wa Chapanga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Vala vandundami vavili pavapikanishili filongu fila, vamukovikela Yesu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu kaghalambuka, kavawona vala vandumindumi vakumkovikela, kavadasha, “Chimusaka liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">Veni vamuyangula, “Labi, kwikala koo?” Labi mana yaki Muwula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Mwisi mupaloli.” Topi vala vandumindumi vayenda, vapawona mahali payikala Yesu. Yaveli lijuva samba lihonga. Veni vayikala pamu na mweni lijuva lila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Andeleya, mlongu mundu Simoni Petili aveli yumu wa vala vandu vavili yivapikanishili filongu fya Yohani mbatisha na kumukovekela Yesu. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Bahala pala Andeleya amuwonili tanila Simoni, mlongu mundu. Kamuwombela, “Tumuwona Mkombola yula yashawuliwili na Chapanga!” Mana yaki ndi Yesu Kilistu. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Pambeli Andeleya kamuyegha Simoni kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamulola Simoni, kadeta, “Yuwi ndi Simoni, mwana wa Yohani, lakini ponopa davakukemi Kefa.” Kefa mana yaki Petili na Petili mana yaki “Ligonguveli.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvakema Filipu na Natanieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki, Yesu akadayileyi kuyenda Galilaya. Kamuwona Filipu, kamuwombela, “Ungovikeli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Filipu aveli mwenikaya wa Betisayida, mbwani yivaikalagha Andeleya pamu na Petili. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Filipu kamuwona Natanieli, kamuwombela, “Tumuwona mundu yula Musa yayandikili filongu fyaki Muchitabu cha Malawu. Vambuyi wuwula wula vayandikili milandu yaki. Ndi Yesu wa Nasaleti, mwana wa Yosefu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Natanieli kamdasha Filipu, “Nahawu yikuweshikana chindu chinofu chifumi Nasaleti?”</para>
  <para style="p">Filipu kamuwombela, “Wisi loli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu pamuwonili Natanieli akumyisila, kadeta, “Loli! Ayu ndi Muyisilaeli nakaka, kwahela ujangi mugati yaki hata padokwa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Natanieli kamudasha, “Kumanya wuliwuli?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamuyangula, “Filipu aveli akalihela kukukema, nenga ngakuwonili pawuveyi pasi ya likuyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Natanieli kayangula, “Muwula, yuwi Mwana wa Chapanga! Yuwi Mutwa wa Isilaeli!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Ukujumila kwanongwa ngakuwombilili kucha ngakuwonili pasi ya libiki lya likuyu? Dawufiwoni findu fikomi kupita afi!” <verse number="51" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kayendelela kuvawombela, “Nakaka nguvawombela, damuwoni kululanga kufuwuka, Makungu va Chapanga pavakwela na kusunuka pambindi ya Mwana wa Mundu!”</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akughalambula machi kuva difwayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lijuva lya tatu kwavelili na lihungu lya kuyiheta mumbwani ya Kana ya mlima wa Galilaya. Mawaki Yesu avelili pala. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wuwula wula Yesu pamu na vandundami vaki valalikiwili mulihungu lila. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Difwayi payipelili, mawaki Yesu kamuwombela Yesu, “Vandu vavahela difwayi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu kamuyangula, “Mau, ukotoo kung'ombela cha kugola, saa ya nenga yikalihela kufika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pambeli mawaki Yesu kavawombela vala vandumindumi, “Chochosi chavawombela, mugoli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pala pavelili na ngwangu sita sigoliwili na migonguveli. Ngwangu asi shavikiwili na Vayawudi kwanongwa ya kutayila machi va kuying'alisha kucha chishovi chawu. Kila ngwangu yimu yayingilagha ndowu mbili awu ndatu sha machi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela vala vandumindumi, “Mumemeshi machi mungwangosi.” Veni vamemesha dali. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavawombela, “Ponopa muteki machi ava muyeghi kwa mkomi wa lihungu.” Vandumindumi vavayegha <verse number="9" style="v"/>machi vala yivaghalambukili kuva difwayi kwa mkomi wa lihungu, mweni kavayesha. Mkomi yula amanyili ha koti kuyifumili difwayi yila, lakini vandumindumi yivamyeghilili machi vamanyili koti kuyifumili. Topi kamukema yula yaheta, <verse number="10" style="v"/>kamuwombela, “Vandu vosi vakutawula tanila difwayi yiveli nofu, pambeli vakutawula yila yingajila kuva nofu. Lakini yuwi kuyilindila difwayi nofu mbaka ponopawu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu kagola muhilu awu wa kwaa aku mbwani ya Kana, mumlima wa Galilaya. Pala palangushili ukomi waki na vandundami vaki vamujumilili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pagolili kala afi, Yesu pamu na mamundu na vandundami vaki na valongumundu vayenda Kapelinaumu. Aku vayikalili majuva madokwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kava munyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 21:12-13, Maliku 11:15-17, Lukasi 19:45-46</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Payiveyi samba lifika lihungu lya Pasaka ya Vayawudi, Yesu ayendili Yelusalemu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pafikili munyumba ya Chapanga, kavawona vandu pavagola uchulusi wa vasenga na vafungami na vangunda na vandu vamonga vagolagha uchulusi wa kukovanika mbiya pamesa shawu.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="10 Money Changer.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="2:14">Vandu yivakovanika mbiya</figure> <verse number="15" style="v"/>Topi kapota luwoyi, kagola ndomondu, kavavinga vosi munyumba ya Chapanga pamu na vasenga na vafungami vawu. Pambeli kaghalambula mesa sha vala vakovanikeyi mbiya na kusimwaghanga mbiya shawu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pambeli kavawombela vala vosi vawuleyi vangunda, “Muwushi findu fyenu apa. Nongwa liki mukuyigola nyumba ya Tati wa nenga kuva soku?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Vanachuli vaki vakumbuka fila filongu fiyandikiwili Mumayandiku Vang'alili, “Chapanga Utami wangu kwanongwa ya nyumba yaku wukunyanya kucha motu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Pambeli vakomi va Vayawudi vamudasha Yesu, “Wuli dawugoli muhilu liki kutulangusha kucha yuwi kuva na uwesu wa kugola afi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Mubowoli ayi nyumba ya Chapanga na nenga dandiyijengi kwa majuva matatu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vayawudi vamudasha, “Ayi nyumba ya Chapanga yajengiwili kwa myaka milongu mchechi na sita! Yuwi ujengi kwa majuva matatu hela?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lakini nyumba ya Chapanga yadetili Yesu yaveli mvili waki mweni. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu pashukukili kufuma kwa vasovili, vandundami vaki vakumbukili chila chadetili. Vajumila Mayandiku Vang'alili na vajumila filongu fila fyadetili Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamanya mahala vawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu paghaveyi Yelusalemu mulihungu lya Pasaka, vandu vatangalili vamjumilili kwanongwa vafiwonili filangushilu fyagolili. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu avajumilili ha, kwanongwa avamanyili vosi finofu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Wuwula wula mweni adayilili ha mundu amtovileli filongu fya mundu wingi, kwanongwa afimanyili fivelili mundima sha vandu.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Nikodemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kwavelili mkomi yumu wa Vayawudi yakemiwa Nikodemu, yaveli yumu wa lipinga lya Mafwalisayu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lijuva limu palumihi kamuyendela Yesu, kamuwombela, “Muwula, tumanya kucha yuwi ndi muwula ulayishiliwi na Chapanga, kwanongwa kwahela mundu yawesha kugola chilangushilu chiwugola yuwi, kucha wula Chapanga kava pamu na mweni ha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kamuyangula, “Nakaka ngukuwombela, kwahela mundu dawuwoni Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga ngajila kuwoneka mwanja wa pili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nikodemu kamdasha, “Mundu daweshi wuliwuli kuwoneka paghava mgogolu? Akuwesha kuwuya wuliwuli mugati ya mtima wa mamundu na kuwoneka mwanja wa pili?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu kamyangula, “Nakaka ngukuwombela, mundu pawoneka ng'odu kwa machi na kwa Mfuki wa Chapanga aweshi ha kuyingila Muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mundu akuwoneka mumvili kwa tati mundu na mamundu, lakini akuwoneka kuva mwana wa Chapanga kwa Mfuki wa Chapanga. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kotoo kuyikang'anika kwanongwa ngukuwombela kucha mkudayiliwa muwoneki mwanja wa pili. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Liyegha likupugha kulidayila. Yuwi ukupikana pawuuwumba, lakini kumanya ha kuwufuma wala kuwuyenda. Nahawu ndi yiva kwa kila mundu yawoneka kwa Mfuki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Topi Nikodemu kamudasha, “Filongu afi fikuweshikana wuliwuli?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kamuyangula, “Yuwi kuva muwula mumlima wa Isilaeli lakini kumanya ng'odu filongu afi? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nakaka ngukuwombela, tukudeta filongu tufimanyili na kutovilela filongu tufiwonili, lakini yumwi mukulema kujumila utovileli wetu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Leki yumwi mukujumila ng'odu pandivawombela filongu fya mlimawu, damujumili wuliwuli pandivawombela filongu fya kumbindi kwa Chapanga? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kwahela mundu yayendili kumbindi ila Mwana wa Mundu weka hela, yasunukili kufuma kumbindi kwa Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kucha Musa wanyasulili njoka wa chumang'andu pambindi ya libiki kula kucheja, wuwula wula Mwana wa Mundu akudayiliwa anyasuliwi, <verse number="15" style="v"/>ili kila mundu yamjumila apati unofu wa jola. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kwanongwa Chapanga avatamili vandu va mlimawu, hata kamutawula Mwana waki wa paweka yamutamili, ili kila mundu yamujumila akotoo kuyaghamila, ila ghavi na unofu wa jola. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Chapanga kamulayisha ha Mwana waki ayisi kuvahigha vandu va mlima awu, ila kamulayisha ayisi kuvalowola.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mundu yoyosi yamjumila Mwana dahighiwi ha, lakini mundu yoyosi yangajila kumujumila, kahighiwa kala, kwanongwa kamjumila ha Mwana wa paweka wa Chapanga. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Damuhighiwi ngimu nahawu: Lwengi luyisa mumlima, lakini vandu vachitama chisi pitu lwengi, kwanongwa fivagola fya wafu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kila mundu yagola findu fya wafu akulunyekwa lwengi na akwisa ha mulwengi ili fyagola fikotoo kuwoneka lipala. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lakini mundu yagola findu finofu akwisa kulwengi, ili fyagola fiwoneki lipala kucha fikugoleka ngimu wadayila Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Yohani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu pamu na vandundami vaki vayenda mlima wa Yudeya. Aku ayikalili nawu pavavabatisha vandu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Wuwula wula Yohani mbatisha aveli akubatisha vandu aku Ayinoni pabehi na Salimu, kwanongwa kula kwavelili na machi vatangalili. Vandu vamuyendela na mweni kavabatisha. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Chipindi chila Yohani mbatisha akalihela kuwopiwa muchijaka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Vanachuli vamu va Yohani mbatisha vakandili kulimbana na Muyawudi yumu kwa chilongu cha chishovi cha kuying'alisha. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Topi vamuyendela Yohani mbatisha, vamuwombela, “muwula, ukumkumbuka mundu yula yaghaveyi pamu na yuwi kula kumwambu ya lweni Yoludani, yula yiwutuwombilili milandu yaki? Ponopa akubatisha na vandu vosi vakumuyendela!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yohani mbatisha kavayangula, “Kwahela mundu yawesha kuva na chindu ngajila kugayiliwa na Chapanga. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mwaveni baha muva vatovileli vangu pandivawombilili, ‘Nenga ndi Kilistu ha, lakini nayishiwa ndimulonguleli.’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yaveli na kamwali yahetiwa ndi bambu wa yaheta. Ghanja wa bambu yaheta akuwoloka pabehi, pavetela na kumupikanisha. Papikana lishu lya bambu yaheta akusekilela munu. Ponopa nenga ngusekilela na sekilelu yangu ponopa yiva. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mweni akudayiliwa ghavi mkomi, nenga ngudayiliwa ndivi mdokwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yayisa kufuma kumbindi kwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mundu yafuma kumbindi kwa Chapanga ndi mkomi wa fyosi. Mundu wa mlimawu ndi wa mlima awu na mweni akudeta filongu fya mlima awu. Lakini mundu yafuma kumbindi kwa Chapanga ndi mkomi wa fyosi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mweni akutovilela fila fyafiwonili na kufipikana, lakini kwahela mundu yajumila lulayilayi lwaki. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mundu yoyosi yajumila lulayilayi lwaki kamanya kucha Chapanga ndi nakaka. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yalayishiwili na Chapanga akudeta filongu fya Chapanga, kwanongwa Chapanga akumumemesha Mfuki waki utangalili. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Tati akumtama Mwana waki, kamgayila uwesu wosi mumawoku vaki. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mundu yamjumila Mwana kana unofu wa jola, lakini yalema kumujumila Mwana, dapati ha unofu wa jola, kwanongwa maya va Chapanga davamuwuyili mweni.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na mdadala wa Samaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mafwalisayu vapikanila kucha Yesu aveli akupata vanachuli vatangalili munu pitu Yohani mbatisha na kuvabatisha. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hata naha mweni Yesu kabatisha ha, ila vandundami vaki ndi vabatisheyi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Topi Yesu papikanishili afi, kawuka Yudeya, kawuya Galilaya. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mumwanja wula, kapitila Samaliya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kafika Sikali Mbwani ya Samaliya, pabehi na chitava cha Yakobi chamupili Yosefu mwana waki. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pala pavelili na litepu lya Yakobi. Yesu ayikalili mulunenengu ya lila litepu, kwanongwa atofyili mwanja. Yaveli pabehi ya pamusi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pambeli mdadala yumu wa mlima wa Samaliya kayisa palitepu kuteka machi. Yesu kamuwombela, “Nguluva machi nandi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Chipindi chila vandundami va Yesu vayendili kumbwani kuhemela filivi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Topi yula mdadala kamuyangula, “Yuwi kuva Muyawudi na nenga Msamaliya. Ukuwesha wuliwuli kunuva machi va kulanda?” Vayawudi vayihashagha ha na Vasamaliya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kamuyangula, “Leki ungamanyili Chapanga akutawula chindu liki na ayu ghani yakuluva machi va kulanda, ungamuluvili mweni na mweni angakupili machi va unofu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yula mdadala kamuwombela, “Bambu, kuvahela chindu cha kutekela machi na litepu lyeni litali munu. Topi dawupati koti machi va unofu? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mbuyi wetu Yakobi ndi yatugayilili yufwi litepu ali. Mweni bahala pamu na vana vaki na vang'ongolu vaki valandili machi vaki. Yuwi wukuyiwona kuva mkomi pitu Yakobi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu kamuyangula, “Kila mundu yalanda machi ava dayumilwi kandi ha. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lakini mundu yoyosi dalanda machi vala dandimgayili, dayumilwi kandi ha hata padokwa. Kwanongwa machi dandimgayili, davavi mugati yaki mukusesa machi na kutuva machi va unofu wa jola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mdadala yula kamuwombela, “Bambu, topi unyimbi machi veni ili ngotoo kuyumilwa kandi na ngotoo kuyisa kandi apa kuteka machi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Yendi kamkemi mlumi waku ayisi apa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yula mdadala kamuyangula, “Nenga ndivahela mlumi.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamuwombela, “Ukudeta nakaka kucha kuvahela mlumi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwanongwa wahetiwili na valumi muhanu na ayu yiwikala nayu ponopa mlumi waku ng'odu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pambeli mdadala yula kamuwombela, “Bambu, nguwona kucha yuwi mbuyi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vavaha vetu vamudadavili Chapanga kumbindi ya chidunda achi, lakini yumwi Vayawudi mukudeta kucha Yelusalemu ndi peni patudayiliwa kumdadavila Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Mawu, ujumili nenga, chipindi chikwisa vandu davamdadavili ha Tati kumbindi ya chidunda achi wala aku Yelusalemu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yumwi Vasamaliya mumanya ha chimuchidadava. Vayawudi tukumdadava Chapanga yitumumanyili na kwa kupitila Vayawudi, Chapanga kavakombola vandu vosi va mumlima. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lakini chipindi dachiyisi na chiva kala, ponopa yivamdadava kwa nakaka vakumudadava tati muufuki na unakaka. Nongwa tati akuvatama vandu yivamdadava ndambu yadayila mweni. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Chapanga ndi Mfuki, vandu yivamdadava vakudayiliwa vamdadavi Mumfuki na unakaka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mdadala yula kamuwombela, “Manya kucha Mkombola yivamkema Kilistu dayisi, payisa datuhimulili filongu fyosi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Nenga yideta na yuwi, ndi mweni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Chipindi chichila Vanachuli vaki vawuya. Vayikanganika kumuwona akuwombana na mdadala. Lakini kwahela mundu yamudashili yula mdadala kucha akudayila liki, awu kumudasha Yesu kucha nongwa liki akuwombana na mdadala yula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Topi mdadala yula kachileka chiyungu chaki cha machi pala, kawuya kumbwani, avawombilili vandu, <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Mwisi mumuloli mundu yang'ombilili milandu yosi yigolili! Ayu Kilistu nda?” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Topi vandu vafuma mumbwani yila, vamyendela Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Chipindi chichila vandundami vaki vamudediveka, pavadeta, “Muwula, wulyi tanila filivi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kavayangula, “Nenga ndina filivi mngajila kufimanya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Vanachuli vaki vakanda kuyidasha, “Kuna mundu yamuyeghilili filivi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Filivi fyangu ndi achi: kugola fila fyadayila Chapanga na kumalisha chichuku chanayishili ndiyigoli. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yumwi mukudeta, ‘Yisighala myesi mchechi chipindi cha kubena chivi.’ Lakini nenga nguvawombela, mugubutuli mesu, muloli fitava! Fivelekwa fikamala, fiva kala kwa kubeniwa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mundu yabena fivelekwa dahombiwi na akuvika fivelekwa pamu kwanongwa ya unofu wa jola. Pambeli mundu yakweta na mundu yabena davasekileli pamu. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa detelu yideta, ‘Mundu yumu akukweta mbeyu na wingi akubena fivelekwa’ wuva nakaka. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nenga ndavalayishili yumwi kuchitava kubena fivelekwa fingajila yumwi kuyiyasha. Vandu vamonga vayashiwili na yumwi mupata fwayida ya chichuku chawu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Vasamaliya vatangalili va mbwani yila vamujumilili Yesu kwanongwa ya filongu fya yula mdadala patovilelili naha, “Ang'ombilili fyosi figolili.” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Vasamaliya vamuyendela Yesu, vamudediveka ayikali pamu na veni na Yesu kayikala nawu kwa majuva mavili. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Vandu vatangalili vamjumilili Yesu kwanongwa ya filongu fyaki. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Vamuwombela yula mdadala, “Ponopa tukujumila, kwanongwa filongu fiwutuwombilili weka ha, ila kwanongwa tupikana twaveni na tumanya nakaka kucha ayu ndi Mlowola wa mlima.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumulowola mwana wa mkomi yumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Pavapitili majuma mavili, Yesu awukili pala ayendili Galilaya. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kwanongwa Yesu mweni adetili, “Mbuyi akutundamiwa ng'odu kayaki.” <verse number="45" style="v"/>Vandu va Galilaya vayendili Yelusalemu kulihungu lya Pasaka. Veni vafiwonili fyosi Yesu fyagolili kula. Topi Yesu pafikili Galilaya, vamlibushilili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kayenda kandi Kana, mumlima wa Galilaya, pala paghalambulili machi kuva difwayi. Apa kwaveli na mkomi yumu yavelili na mwana mtami aku Kapelinaumu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Topi mkomi yula papikanishili Yesu kafuma Yudeya kafika mumlima wa Galilaya, kamyendela, kamluva amlowoli mwana waki yatamikili dabadaba. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Pamuwona ng'odu chilangushilu na findu fya filoja mujumili ha!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yula mkomi kamuwombela, “Bambu, deku tuyendi ponopa mwana wangu akali hela kusova.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Yendi, mwana waku mnofu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Mundu yula kajumila filongu fya Yesu, pambeli kayenda. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Paghaveyi mudeha akuwuya kayaki, vatanganili na vandumindumi vaki, vamuwombela, “Mwana waku kanana!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Mweni kavadasha chipindi liki mwana waki pananili. Veni vamuyangula, “Yikaveli saa saba pamusi.” <verse number="53" style="v"/>Pambeli tati ayu kamanya kucha yikaveli pamusi yiyila Yesu pamuwombilili, “Mwana waku akunana.” topi mweni na nyumba yaki yosi vamjumila Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Achi ndi chilangushilu cha pili Yesu chalangushili yaveli paghaveyi akuwuya Galilaya kufuma Yudeya.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumulowola mtami wa aku Betisata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kayenda Yelusalemu kulihungu lya Vayawudi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Aku Yelusalemu pabehi na mlyangu wukemiwa “Mlyangu wa Fungami” Kwaveli na litanda lya machi livalikema kwa Chibulaniya Betisata na lyeni lyaveli na fibudi fimuhanu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Vatami vatangalili vawonjagha mula mufibudi fila vangalimesu na vandevindevi na vapombalili. Vavetilagha machi vatimbushiwi, <verse number="4" style="v"/>kwanongwa makungu wa Bambu asunukeyi teputepu mulitanda lila na kutimbusha machi. Mtami yava wa kwaa kuyingila mulitanda machi pavatimbushiwa, ananili utami wowosi wavelinawu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pala kwavelili mundu yumu mtami kwa myaka milongu mitatu na minani. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu pamuwonili mundu ayu kawonja pala, kamanya kucha aveli mtami kwa myaka yitangalili. Kamdasha, “Ukudayila kunana?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yula mtami kamuyangula, “Bambu, nenga ndivahela mundu wa kunyegha mumachi pavatimbushiwa. Kila panyesha kuyingila, mundu wingi akunongulela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Tandamuki, toli litefu lyaku, yendi.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Tepu mundu yula kanana, katola litefu lyaki, kakanda kuyenda.</para>
  <para style="p">Chilongu achi chagolikili Mulijuva lya kupumulila, <verse number="10" style="v"/>topi vakomi va Vayawudi vamuwombela yula mundu yalowuliwili, “Nalelu Lijuva lya kupumulila. Malawu vetu vakukanisha mundu yoyosi kupapa litefu mulijuva ali.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lakini mweni kavawombela, “Yula mundu yanowulili mweni ndi ang'ombilili, ‘Toli litefu lyaku, yendi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vamudasha, “Ayu mundu yakuwombilili toli litefu lyaku yendi ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lakini mundu yula amanyili ha kucha yula yamulowulili aveli ghani, kwanongwa kwaveli na vandu vatangalili na Yesu awukili kala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kamuwona mundu yula mugati ya nyumba ya Chapanga. Kamuwombela, “Pikanishi, ponopa kunana. Kotoo kugola kandi sambi, ili chikotoo kukufika chilongu chawafu munu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pambeli mundu yula kayenda, kavawombela vakomi va Vayawudi kucha Yesu ndi yamulowulili. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kwanongwa Yesu agolili chindu achi mulijuva lya Kupumulila, Vayawudi vakandili kumuvipila. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Topi Yesu kavawombela, “Tati wangu akugola chichuku majuva vosi, wuwula wula nenga ngudayiliwa goli chichuku nga Tati wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwanongwa ya filongu afi, vakomi va Vayawudi vadayilagha kumuwulagha Yesu, kwanongwa ya kuvifya Lijuva lya Kupumulila weka hela ha, ila wuwula wula kwanongwa adetili Chapanga ndi Tati mundu nahawu ayigolili kalingana na Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Uwesu wa Mwana wa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Nakaka nguvawombela, Mwana akuwesha ha kugola chindu weka hela. Akuwesha kugola chila chamuwona Tati mundu pagola weka, kwanongwa chochosi chagola Tati, wuwula wula Mwana wa Chapanga akugola. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nongwa Tati akumtama Mwana na kamulangusha findu fyosi fyagola mweni. Kandi damulangushi findu fikomi kupita afi, mwavosi yumwi damwikang'aniki. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kucha wula Tati pashukusha vasovili kuvawuyishila unofu, wuwula wula Mwana akuvagayila unofu vala yivavadayila. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kandi Tati akumuhigha mundu yoyonda ha, lakini kamupa Mwana chichuku chosi cha kuhigha, <verse number="23" style="v"/>ili vandu vosi vamjumili Mwana kucha wula wuvamtundamila Tati. Mundu yoyosi yalema kumtundamila Mwana, akumlema Tati yamlayishili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Nakaka nguvawombela, yapikana chilongu cha nenga na kumjumila yula yanayishili, dapati unofu wa jola. Dahighiwi ha, kwanongwa kachama kala njifwa na kayingila muunofu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nakaka nguvawombela, chipindi chikwisa, ponopa chifika kala, vandu vasovili davapikanili lishu lya Mwana wa Chapanga na vala vosi davalipikanishi, davayikali. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kucha wula mweni Tati wavelili chikandilu cha unofu, wuwula wula kamugola Mwana waki kuva chikandilu cha unofu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Wuwula wula kamupa uwesu wa kuhigha, kwanongwa mweni ndi Mwana wa Mundu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mkotoo kuyikang'anika filongu afi, kwanongwa dachiyisi chipindi, vandu vosi vasovili davapikanili lishu lyaki. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Na veni davafumi musembi shawu. Vala yivagolili findu fya usangi davashukuki na kuva vanofu na vala vagolili wafu davashukuki na kuhighiwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Vatovilela va Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>“Nenga mweni ng'weshi ha kugola chindu chochosi. Nenga nguhigha kucha wang'ombela Chapanga na highilu yangu ya nakaka. Ngugola ha kucha wudayilili nenga, ila kucha wadayilili yula yanayishili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Pandiyijuma nimweni, utovileli wa nenga wuva nakaka ha. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lakini kuna wingi yandovilela na nenga manya kucha kila chatovilela chiva nakaka. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yumwi mwavalayishili vandu kwa Yohani mbatisha na mweni avawombilili utovileli. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nenga ngudayila ha utovileli wa mundu, ila ngudeta filongu afi ili mulowuliwi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yohani aveli kucha luliku luyaka na kulangasha na yumwi Mwasekilili lwengi lwaki kwa chipindi chidokwa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nenga ndina utovileli mkomi pitu wula wutawuliwili na Yohani mbatisha. Kwanongwa chichuku shanyimbili Tati ndisimalili, fichuku figola fikulangusha kucha Tati ndi yanayishili. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Tati, mweni yanayishili akundovelela. Yumwi mukalihela kupikanisha lishu lyaki wala mukalihela kuwona wushu waki chipindi chochosi. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yumwi mukuchivika ha chilongu chaki mugati yenu, kwanongwa yumwi mukumjumila ha yula yalayishiwili na mweni. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yumwi mkusoma Mayandiku Vang'alili kwanongwa mukuyihola kucha mugati yaki damupati unofu wa jola. Mayandiku vavava ndi yivandovilela! <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lakini yumwi mukulema kwisa kwa nenga mupati unofu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Ndadayilagha ha kuyanga ukomi kufuma kwa vandu. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Lakini manya kucha yumwi mumutama ha Chapanga mundima shenu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nenga nyisa kwa litawa lya Tati wangu, mumbokela ha. Lakini payiva mundu wingi akwisa kwa litawa lyaki mweni, yumwi damumupokeli. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Mukudayila kuyijuma mwaveni, wala mkusaka ha ukomi wa Chapanga weka hela! Ponopa damuweshi wuliwuli kujumila nenga? <verse number="45" style="v"/>Mkotoo kuyihola kucha nenga dandivagotoleli kwa Tati. Musa, yumwi yimushuvilileyi ndi davagotoleli. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Leki nakaka mungamjumilili Musa, mungajumilili wuwowu na nengapa, nongwa Musa ayandikili milandu ya nenga. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Lakini leki mukujumila ha fila Musa fyayandikili, mukuwesha wuliwuli kujumila fila fideta nenga?”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvagayila filivi vandu vatangalili</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 14:13-21, Maliku 6:30-44, Lukasi 9:10-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kajabuka lihiva lya Galilaya awu lihiva lya Tibeliya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lipinga likomi lya vandu lyamkovikelili kwanongwa vafiwonili filangushilu fyagolagha fya kuvalowola vatami. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kakwela kuchidunda, kayikala pamu na vandundami vaki. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lihungu lya Pasaka ya Vayawudi lyaveli samba lifika. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu pawonili lipinga likomi lya vandu likumwisila, kamuwombela Filipu, “Koti tukuwesha kuhemela filivi fya kuvagayila vandu vosi ava?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu adashili naha ili amuteghi Filipu, kwanongwa mweni amanyili kucha dagoli wuliwuli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Filipu kamuyangula, “Dinali mya mbili hela dasikwili ha kuhemela mibumunda ya kukwila kila mundu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mwanachuli yumu wa Yesu litawa lyaki Andeleya, mlongumundu Simoni Petili kamuwombela Yesu, <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Apa pana mwana kava na mibumunda muhanu na fisomba fivili. Lakini achi chindu ng'odu kwa vandu vatangalili nahawu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela vandundami vaki, “Muvawombeli vandu vayikali pasi.” Pahali pala pavelili na lugobi posi. Topi vandu vosi vayikala pasi. Valulumi weka mulipinga lila vavelili milongu mya muhanu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kayitola yila mibumunda, kamulumba Chapanga, kayimetula na kuvagayila vandu vosi vayikalili pala. Katola fisomba, kagola ngimu wuwula wula. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vandu pavayikutili kala, Yesu kavawombela vanachuli vaki, “Mukungashi filivi fisighalili chikotoo kuyaghamila chindu chochosi.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Topi vandundami vakungasha fisighalili, vamemesha fitandavala lilongu na fivili fya fibumunda fisighalili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Vandu pavawonili chilangushilu chagolili Yesu, vawomba, “Nakaka ayu ndi mbuyi yayisa pamlima.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu pamanyili kucha vandu vakudayila kumtola ghavi mutwa kwa liwovi, kawuka, kayenda kuchidunda weka yaki.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuyendayenda mumachi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 14:22-33, Maliku 6:45-52</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mbungamihi payiyingileyi, vandundami vaki vayenda kulihiva. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Vayipaka muwatu, vajabuki kumwambu ya lihiva vayendi Kapelinaumu. Lwisa lwayingilili kala, Yesu aveli akalihela kuvayisila. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mulihiva kwavelili na majinga kwanongwa liyegha lyaveli likomi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Vanachuli vaki pavayendili ngombu kucha muhanu naha, vamuwona Yesu akuyendayenda mumbindi ya machi, akwisa pabehi na watu wula. Vatila munu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Nengapa! Mkotoo kutila!” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pambeli vadayilili kumpaka muwatu wula, teputepu watu wuyipayika payipalu.</para>
  <para style="s">Vandu vakumsaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki, vandu yivasighalili kula kumwambu ya lihiva vamanyili kucha kwavelili watu wumu hela pala. Vamanyili wuwula kucha Yesu kayipaka ha pamu na vandundami vaki, ila vandundami vaki vayendili weka hela. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pambeli matu vamonga vafumili Tibeliya vafika pala vandu pavalili mibumunda, Bambu padadavili kala kwa Chapanga. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Topi vandu pavamanyili kucha Yesu pamu na vandundami vaki vawuka pala, vayipakili mumatu vawu, vayenda Kapelinaumu kumusaka Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndilya ya Unofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Vandu pavamuwonili Yesu mwambu wingi wa lihiva, vamudasha, “Muwula, kufika ndili apa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Nakaka nguvawombela, mukunzaka kwanongwa mwawonili filangushilu figolili ha, ila kwanongwa mwalili mibumunda mwikuta. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mkotoo kuyifwashila filivi yifiwola, ila muyifwashili filivi fya unofu wa jola. Mwana wa Mundu mweni Tati kamjumisha davapi chilivi achi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Veni vamdasha, “Tugoli liki ili tuweshi kugola chila Chapanga chadayila tugoli?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Achi ndi chindu Chapanga akudayila mugoli, mumujumili yula yamulayishili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Vamudasha, “Dawugoli chilangushilu liki ili tuloli na tukujumili? Dawugoli liki? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Vavaha vetu valya filivi fikemiwa mana kula kucheja, kucha wuyiyandikiwili Mumayandiku, ‘Avayikutishili mibumunda yifumili kumbindi kwa Chapanga.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Nakaka nguvawombela, Musa ha yavapili filivi fila fya kumbindi kwa Chapanga. Ila Tati wangu ndi yavapa filivi fya nakaka fya kumbindi kwa Chapanga. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kwanongwa filivi fyatugayila Chapanga ndi mundu yula yayisa kufuma kumbindi na kuvagayila unofu vandu vaveli pamlima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Vamuwombela, “Bambu, tugayili filivi afi majuva vosi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Nenga ndi filivi fya unofu. Mundu yayisa kwa nenga dapikani njala kandi ha na mundu yajumila nenga dayumilwi hata padokwa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Lakini kucha wundivawombilili, mung'ona ingava mukujumila ha. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Vosi vanyimbili Tati davayisi kwa nenga na nenga dandimvingi ng'odu mundu yoyosi yayisa kwa nenga. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kwanongwa nyisa kufuma kumbindi kugola fila fidayila nenga ha, lakini kugola fyadayila yula yanayishili. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mweni yanayishili akudayila naha, ngotoo kumuyaghamisha hata yumu wa vala vanyimbili, lakini ndivashukushi vosi mulijuva lya mwishu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kwanongwa chadayila Tati wa nenga achi, kila mundu yamulola Mwana na kumjumila daghavi na unofu wa jola na nenga dandimshukushi mulijuva lya mwishu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Topi Vayawudi vakanda kung'ong'oleka nongwa Yesu adetili, “Nenga ndi filivi fifumili kumbindi kwa Chapanga.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Vadeta, “Ayu Yesu mwana wa Yosefu nda? Tuvamanya tati mundu na Mamundu! Ponopa akuwesha wuli wuli kudeta kucha kafuma kumbindi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Mukotoo kuying'ong'utekela. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kwahela mundu yawesha kwisa kwa nenga ila kwa liwovi lya Tati yanayishili. Na yayisa kwa nenga dandimshukushi mundu ayu lijuva lya mwishu. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Vambuyi vayandika naha, ‘Vandu vosi davawuliwi na Chapanga.’ Na mundu yoyosi yampikanisha Tati na kukamula mawuli vaki dayisi kwa nenga. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kwahela mundu yamuwonili Tati, ila yula yafumili kwa Chapanga, mweni weka hela ndi yamuwonili Tati. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nakaka nguvawombela, mundu yajumila nenga kana unofu wa jola. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nenga ndi filivi fya Unofu. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Vavaha venu valili mana kula kucheja lakini vasovili. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Lakini afi ndi filivi fifumili kumbindi kwa Chapanga, mundu yoyosi yaghalya filivi afi dasovi ha. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Nenga ndi filivi fya unofu fisunukili kufuma kumbindi kwa Chapanga. Leki mundu yoyosi paghalya filivi afi, dayikali jola. Na filivi afi ndi mvili wa nenga wundiwutawula ili vandu va mlimawu vavi na Unofu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Vayawudi vakandili kulimbana kwa maya veni kwa veni, “Mundu ayu daweshi wuli wuli kutugayila mvili waki tulyi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Nakaka nguvawombela, pamulya ng'odu mvili wa Mwana wa Mundu na kulanda mwasi waki, damuupoti Unofu mugati yenu. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Mundu yoyosi yaghalya mvili wa nenga na kulanda mwasi wa nenga, dapati Unofu wa jola na nenga dandimshukushi mulijuva lya mwishu. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Kwanongwa mvili wa nenga ndi filivi fya nakaka na mwasi wa nenga ndi chilandi cha nakaka. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Mundu yoyosi yaghalya mvili wa nenga na kulanda mwasi wa nenga, akwikala mugati ya nenga na nenga nguyikala mugati ya mweni. <verse number="57" style="v"/>Kucha wula Tati waveli Mnofu wanayishili nenga na nenga ndina Unofu kwanongwa ya Tati. Wuwula wula mundu yaghalya mvili wa nenga daghavi na unofu kwanongwa ya nenga. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Filivi afi fyasunukili kufuma kumbindi kwa Chapanga kucha fila ha fivalili vambuyi vetu kula kucheja na kusova. Lakini mundu yoyosi yaghalya filivi afi daghavi na unofu wa jola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Yesu adetili afi paghaveyi akuwula munyumba ya kudadavila aku Kapelinaumu.</para>
  <para style="s">Chilongu cha unofu wa jola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Vandu vatangalili yivamkovikelili pavapikanishili naha, vadeta, “Ayi milandu yidindala! Ghani yawesha kuyimanya?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Yesu amanyili kucha vandundami vaveli vakung'ong'utekela chilongu achi, ngajila kumuwombela mundu. Topi kavadasha, “Chilongu achi chikuvagola muvi na chipwembwi? <verse number="62" style="v"/>Ponopa dayivi wuliwuli pamumuwona Mwana wa Mundu akuwuya kumbindi kula kwaghaveyi dahili? <verse number="63" style="v"/>Mfuki ndi yayegha unofu, liwovi lya mundu likujakwa chindu ha. Filongu findivawombilili ndi filongu fya Mfuki wa Chapanga yayegha Unofu. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Hata naha, vamu va yumwi vangajila kujumila.” Yesu adetili nawula kwanongwa amanyili tangila ngengi vala vangajila kumjumila na yula yadayila kumshengeta. <verse number="65" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kadeta, “Ndi nongwa ndadetili kucha kwahela mundu yawesha kwisa kwa nenga mbaka Tati amtangi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Kwanongwa ya afi fyadetili, vala yivamkovikeleyi vatangalili vamuleka, vamukovikela kandi ha. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Topi Yesu kavadasha vala vandundami vaki lilongu na vavili, “Wuli na yumwi mukudayila kuyiyendela?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>Simoni Petili kamuyangula, “Bambu, datuyendi kwa ghani? Yuwi kuna filongu fya unofu wa jola. <verse number="69" style="v"/>Ponopa tukujumila na tumanya kucha yuwi kuva Mng'alili yufumili kwa Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Nenga ndi yindivashawulili yumwi lilongu na vavili? Lakini muyenu yumu Lijangavandu!” <verse number="71" style="v"/>Yesu adetli naha nongwa ya Yudasi, mwana wa Simoni Sikaliyoti, yumu wa vala vandundami lilongu na vavili. Pambeli Yuda ndi daamshengeti Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu pamu na valongu vaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu ayendili Galilaya, pafumila Yudeya nongwa Vayawudi vadayilili kumuwulagha. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lihungu lya Vayawudi lya fidimililu lyaveli pabehi, <verse number="3" style="v"/>ponopa valongu vaki vamuwombela, “Uwuki apa yendi Yudeya, ili vandundami vaku vakaloli mihilu yiwugola aku. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwahela mundu yadayila kumanyika na vandu ayifisi. Topi kwanongwa ukugola findu ngimu afi, wuyilangushi kwa vandu vosi vakuwoni.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nongwa hata valongu mundu vamjumila ha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Chipindi changu chifika ha, lakini chipindi chiva jola. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vandu va mlima vaweshi ha kuvanyekwa yumwi, lakini vakunyekwa nenga kwanongwa nguvatovilela findu fya wafu fivagola. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yumwi muyendi kulihungu, nenga nguyenda ha kwanongwa chipindi changu chikali hela kufika.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pavawombilili kala naha, kayikala Galilaya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mulihungu lya Fidimililu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Valongu mundu pavayendili kala kula kulihungu, Yesu ayendili kula kulihungu wuwowu, lakini ayendili kwa chifisu ngajila kuyilangusha lipala hela. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kula kulihungu Vakomi va Vayawudi vakamsakeyi pavayidasha, “Kava koti yula?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mulipinga lila kwavelili na lupwepu lukomi lwa mweni. Vamu vawomba, “Mweni mundu mnofu.” Vamu vayangula, “Ng'odu, akuvayaghamisha vandu.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lakini kwahela hata mundu yumu yamuwombilili pawelu, kwanongwa vayipwelishili vakomi va Vayawudi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pambeli pagati ya lihungu lila, Yesu kayingila Munyumba ya Chapanga, kakanda kuwula. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Topi vakomi va Vayawudi vajuluvala kunu pavadeta, “Mundu ayu kapata koti luhunja ngajila kuwuliwa kuchuli?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Mawuli vawula va nenga ha, ila va yula yanayishili. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Leki mundu padayila kugola fila fyadayila Chapanga, damanyi mawuli vangu vakufuma kwa Chapanga awu ngudeta kwa uwesu wangu ndimweni. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mundu yadeta kwa uwesu waki mweni akusaka ukomi waki mweni. Lakini yula yasaka lujumu lwa yula yamulayishili, ayu ndi muna unakaka na kavahela udesi wowosi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Musa avagayilili ng'odu Malawu? Hata naha kwahela hata yumu gati ya yumwi yavakamula Malawu. Ponopa chimudayilila kung'ulaghila chindu liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pala vandu vamyangula, “Kuna chinyamkela yuwi! Ghani yadayila kukuwulaya?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Kuna muhilu wumu wugolili wuvagolili mwikang'aniki vosi yumwi. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yumwi mukudumula jandu hata Lijuva lya kupumulila nongwa Musa avalayililili kwingila jandu nakaka dayivi kwa Musa ha, ila kwa vambuyi venu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Topi, leki mukuwesha kuvayingisha jandu vandu hata Lijuva lya Kupumulila, ili mukotoo kuvaleka Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa, nongwa liki mukungalalila kwa kumulowola mundu mulijuva lya Kupumulila? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mukotoo kuhigha milandu panji hela, ila muhighi kwa unakaka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi Kilistu?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Vandu vamu va Yelusalemu vawomba, “Ayu mundu yula yivamsaka vamuwulayi nda? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mumloli ponopa akudeta pawelu hela, wala vakumuwombela chindu ha! Awu pamongapa vakomi naveni vamanya nakaka kucha ayu ndi Kilistu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lakini tumanya mahali mundu ayu pafuma. Kilistu payisa kwahela mundu damanyi mahali kwafumili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Topi Yesu pawuleyi Munyumba ya Chapanga adetili naha kwa lishu likomi, “Yina yumwi mukuyijuma kucha mumanya na pafumili. Nyisa kwa liwovi lyangu nimweni ha, lakini yanayishili muna unakaka. Yumwi mumumanya ha, <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lakini nenga ndimumanya kwanongwa ndafumili kwa mweni na mweni ndi yanayishili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Topi vamusakili vamukamuli, lakini kwahela mundu yamukamulili kwanongwa chipindi chaki chafikili ha. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Vandu vatangalili mulipinga lila vamujumilili mweni, pavadeta, “Kilistu payisa dagoli filangushilu fitangalili munu pitu mundu ayu?”</para>
  <para style="s">Machonda valayishiwili kumkamula Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mafwalisayu vapikanila kung'ong'oleka mulipinga lya vandu kwa mundu yula, veni pamu na vatambika vakomi vavalayisha vamachonda vamukamuli Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Topi Yesu kacha, “Ngali na yumwi chipindi chidokwa hela, pambeli dang'uyi kwa mweni yanayishili. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Damunzaki lakini damung'oni ng'o, yumwi damufikili ha pala dandivi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Vayawudi vayidasha veni kwa veni, “Ayu dayendi koti pangajila yufwi kumuwona? Dayendi kwa Vayawudi yivapwililikili Muugiliki na kuvawula Vagiliki? <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kana mana liki wadetili, Damunzaki lakini damung'oni ha na pala dandivi damuweshi ha kufika?”</para>
  <para style="s">Nyeni sha machi va unofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Lijuva lya mwishu lya Lihungu lila lyaveli lijuva likomi lya Lihungu, Yesu kawoloka kudeta, kwa lishu likomi, “Mundu payumilwa, ayisi kwa nenga alandi. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mundu yoyosi yajumila nenga, Kucha yivadeta Mayandiku Vang'alili, ‘Nyeni sha machi va Unofu dasimwayiki kufuma mugati ya ndima yaki’ ” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu padeteyi naha, aveli akudeta chilongu cha Mfuki Mng'alili, yula vandu yivamveta kumuyanga. Mbaka chipindi chila, Mfuki avelili akalihela kwisa, kwanongwa Yesu aveli akalihela kujumiwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Vandu vakulekanila kwanongwa ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Vandu vamonga mula mulipinga pavapikanishili filongu fila, vadeta, “Mundoyu nakaka ndi yula Mbuyi wa Chapanga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Vamu vadeta, “Ayu ndi Kilistu!”</para>
  <para style="p">Lakini vamu vayidasha, “Yingaweshili wuli wuli Kilistu afumi Galilaya? <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mayandiku Vang'alili vadeta ng'odu kucha Kilistu dawoneki kufuma mulukolu lwa Mutwa Dawudi na mumbwani ya Betelehemu?” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Topi vandu vakulekanila mula mulipinga kwanongwa ya Yesu. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Vandu vamu vadayilagha kumuwopa, lakini kwa hela mundu yayeshili kumkamula.</para>
  <para style="s">Vakomi wa Vayawudi vahela ujumilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Pambeli vala machonda vawuya kwa Vatambika vakomi pamu na Mafwalisayu, veni vavadasha machonda, “Nongwa liki Yesu mumuyegha ng'odu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Vamachonda vayangula, “Kwahela mundu yawesha kulonga kucha ayu yavalonga!” <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mafwalisayu vavadasha, “Wuli na yumwi wuwowu mujangiwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>“Ghani pagati ya vakomi vetu awu Mafwalisayu yamujumilili? <verse number="49" style="v"/>Lakini lipinga lyosi ali lya vandu vangajila kumanya Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa, lilapiwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nikodemu, yula yamyendileyi Yesu paulongolu, avelili yumu wa Mafwalisayu avelili bahala. Kavawombela, <verse number="51" style="v"/>“Kulingana na Malawu, tukuwesha ha kumuhigha mundu ngajila kumupikanisha tanila na kumanya fila fyagolili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Veni vamuyangula, “Na yuwi wuwowu kufuma Galilaya? Kaloleshi uswanu mayandiku vang'alili dawuwoni kucha Galilaya kukufuma ha mbuyi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mayandiku va pakwandi pamu na vavaha vamonga vatovilela vavelili vahela Yoh 7:53-8:11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Pambeli kila mundu kawuya kayaki.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mdadala yakamuliwi muuwoni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pambeli vandu vosi vayendili kaya, Yesu ayendili kuchidunda cha miseyituni. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki lumbutila kayenda kandi munyumba ya Chapanga. Vandu vosi vamuyendela, mweni kayikala akuvawula. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Vawula va Malawu pamu na Mafwalisayu vamuyendela mdadala yumu yivamkamulili muuwoni. Vamuwolosha pagati ya veni. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pambeli vamudasha Yesu, “Muwula, mdadala ayu tumkamula muuwoni. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mumalawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa vatulayilili yufwi vatuwombela mdadala kuchaa ayu atovangiwi na miganga mbaka asovi. Ponopa yuwi ukucha wuli?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Vadetili naha kwa kumyesha, vapati chilongu cha kumuhigha. Lakini Yesu agondamili pasi, kayandika pasi na chala chaki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pavayendelili kumudasha, Yesu katandamuka kavawombela, “Mundu yangajila sambi kwa yumwi atoli liganga akandi kumtova.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pambeli kagondama kandi, akuyandika pasi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pavapikanishili nawula, vakanda kuwuka yumu yumu, valongulili vavaha. Yesu kasighala pamu na yula mdadala kawoloka bahala. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu patandamukili kamudasha yula mdadala, “Vava koti vala vandu? Kwahela yakuhighili kuva muna nongwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yula mdadala kamyangula, “Bambu, kwahela hata yumu!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kadeta, “Hata nenga ngukuhigha ng'odu uyiyendeli, lakini ponopa ukotoo kugola kandi sambi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lwengi lwa pamlima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu paywangili kandi na Vayawudi kavawombela, “Nenga lwengi lwa mlima. Yangovekela nenga dayendi yendi ng'odu mulwisa daghavi na lwengi lwa Unofu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mafwalisayu vamuwombela, “Yuwi ukuyitovelela umweni, topi, utovileli waku wuva nakaka ha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Mani nguyitovilela nimweni utoveleli wa nenga wuva nakaka, wula nenga ngumanya kufumili na kunyenda. Lakini yumwi mumanya ng'odu kufumili awu kunyenda. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yumwi mukuhigha milandu ya vandu, nenga ngumuhigha mundu ha. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hata pahigha, ngulamula fya maha, kwanongwa nenga ndiva weka hela ha, Tati yanayishili kava pamu na nenga. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yiyandikwa Mumalawu venu utovileli wa vandu vavili wa nakaka. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nenga nguyitovilela ndimweni na mweni Tati yanyeghili akundovelela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Veni vamudasha, “Tati waku kakoti?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kayangula, “Yumwi mumanya ng'odu nenga, wala Tati wangu mumumanya ha. Leki mungamanyili nenga, mungamumanyili wuwula na Tati wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu kadeta filongu fila muchumba gati cha kuvikila sanduku lya mbiya paghaveyi akuwula Munyumba ya Chapanga. Kwahela mundu yamkamulili nongwa saa yaki yaveli yikali hela kufika.</para>
  <para style="s">Kunyenda damuweshi ng'odu kufika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela kandi, “Nenga nguyenda, damnzaki, damusovi mu sambi shenu kunyenda nenga yumwi damuweshi ng'odu kufika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vakomi va Vayawudi vayidasha, “Mani dayiwulayi? Kadeta, kwayenda datuweshi ng'odu kufika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Yumwi va pasi, nenga wa kumbindi. Yumwi va mlima awu, nenga wa mlima awu ha. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ndivawombela damsovi mu sambi shenu. Damusovi mu sambi shenu leki mukujumila ng'odu kucha Nenga ndi Mweni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Veni vamudasha, “Yuwi kuva ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kavayangula, “Chilongu chichila chila ndivawombilili kufumila dayili! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ndiva na fitangalili fya kuvawombela na kuvahigha yumwi. Yula yanayishili kava nakaka na nenga nguwuwombela mlima filongu fimbikanishili kufuma kwa mweni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Veni vamanyili ng'odu ngimu Yesu akuywanga milandu ya Tati mundu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Topi Yesu kadeta, “Pamumujuma kala Mwana wa Mundu, damumanyi kucha ‘Nenga ndi Mweni’, Ngugola findu fyosi kwa liwovi lyangu ha, ngudeta fila fyanayili Tati. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yula yanayishili kavapamu na nenga, mweni kaneka weka hela ha, kwanongwa majuva vosi ngugola fila fyadayilili mweni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mweni padeteyi afi vandu vatangalili vamjumilili.</para>
  <para style="s">Unakaka dawutugoli tupekisuki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela Vayawudi yivamjumilili, “Ngimu pamukombishela mawuli va nenga nakaka damuvi vandundami va nenga. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Damuwumanyi unakaka na unakaka dawuvagoli mupekisuki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Veni vamyangula, “Yufwi tuvaleli va Ibulahimu, twakali hela kuva vavanda va mundu yoyosi yula. Kuna mana liki paudeta, ‘Damuvi pekesu’?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Nakaka nguvawombela, mundu yoyosi yagola sambi kava mvanda wa sambi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mvanda akwikala ha pakaya majuva vosi, Mwana akwikala kaya majuva vosi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mwana pavavavika pekesu, damuvi pekesu nakaka. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Manya kucha yumwi uleli wa Ibulahimu, yumwi mkuyesha kung'ulaya kwanongwa mulema kupokela mawuli vangu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nenga nguvawombela fila fyanangushili Tati wangu, lakini yumwi mkugola fila fyavawombilili vatati venu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Veni vamuyangula, “Yina tati wetu Ibulahimu!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kavayangula, “Leki yumwi mungaveli vana va Ibulahimu,” Yesu kayangula, “mungagolili fila fyagolili Ibulahimu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Nenga nguvawombela nakaka fimbikanishili kufuma kwa Chapanga, ponopa mukunzaka mung'ulayi nenga. Ibulahimu agolili nga nahau ha! <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yumwi mkugola chichuku sha tati wenu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Veni vamuwombela, “Yufwi tuwonekela muuwoni ha, tuva na Tati yumu hela ndi Chapanga. ‘Nakaka twavana vaki’”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Kucha Chapanga angaveli Tati wenu nakaka, mungandamili, kwanongwa fuma kwa Chapanga ponopa ndiva apa. Nenga nyisa ndiyilata ndimweni ha, ila mweni ndi yanayishili. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Wuliwuli mukufimanya ng'odu afi fideta? Ponopa mukulemwa kupikanisha unjagila wa nenga. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Yumwi tati wenu Lijangavandu, mkugola milandu yadayilili tati wenu. Kufumila pakwandi mweni avelili akuwulagha vandu. Kana chiganu ng'odu, padeta fya hela akudeta fifuma mumunda yaki mweni, kwa nogwa mweni mudesi na tati wa udesi. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nenga nguwomba nakaka, lakini mkujumila ng'odu nenga. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Ghani wa yumwi kana utovelela kucha nenga ndiva na sambi? Nenga ngudeta nakaka, mbona yumwi mkujumila ng'odu nenga? <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yula yafumili kwa Chapanga, akupikanisha fya Chapanga, leki pamumpikanisha ng'odu kwanongwa yumwi va Chapanga ha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Vayawudi vamdasha, “Yufwi tukudeta finofu ng'odu patudeta yuwi Msamaliya na yuwi kuva na chinyamkela?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu kayangula, “Nenga ndivahela chinyamkela, nenga ngumutundamila Tati wangu na yumwi mukubedala nenga. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nenga ngusaka ukomi ha, kwaveli mweni yasaka na kana luhighilu lwa nakaka. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Nakaka nguvawombela: yakamula mawuli va nenga dasovi ng'odu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Vayawudi ndavawomba, “Ponopa tumanya kucha yuwi kuna chinyamkela! Ibulahimu kasova na vambuyi vasova, ponopa yuwi ukuwomba, mundu pakamula chilongu chaku dasovi ha jola. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Wuli ukwigola kuva mkomi pitu Tati wetu Ibulahimu yasovili? Na Vambuyi vetu vasova wuwula. Yuwi ukuyigola kwa ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Ukomi wangu ndimweni, chindu ha. Tati wangu, yumwi mukudeta ndi Tati wenu ndi yajuma nenga, ayu ndi Chapanga. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Hata yumwi mwamumanyili ha, nenga ndimumanya. Padeta ndimumanya ng'odu, dandivi ngudeta fya hela kucha yumwi, nenga ndimumanya na chilongu chaki nguchikamula. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Ibulahimu, tati wenu anemelili paliwonili lijuva lya kwisa nenga, mweni kasekelela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Vayawudi vamuwombela, “Yuwi ukali hela kuva na myaka milongu muhanu ya kuyikala, yuwi kumuwona Ibulahimu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Nguvawombela nakaka Ibulahimu akali kuwoneka, nenga navelili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Bahala pala vasola migonguveli vamtovi, lakini Yesu kayifisa, pambeli kafuma munyumba ya Chapanga.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlowola yangajila kulola kukandila awoneki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu papiteyi kamuwona mundu yumu, ngalimesu kufumila kuwoneka kwaki. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Vanachuli vaki vamudasha, “Muwula! Ghani yagolili sambi, Mundu ayu awu vala vamlelili ngalimesu.?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kayangula, “Ayu kagola ng'odu sambi na vala vamlelili vagola sambi ha, nongwa chichuku cha Chapanga chiwoneki kwa mweni. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yikudayiliwa tugoli fichuku fya mweni yanyeyili nongwa ponopa pamusi na lumihi lukwisa mundu daweshi ng'odu kugola chichuku. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pandiva mumlima awu, nenga lwengi lwa mlima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pawombili nawula, katema mita pasi, kadaka na uganga kagola mitika, kamushagha mumesu mundu yula ngalimesu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kamuwombela, “Yendi kayipwembuli kuwushu mulitanda lya Siloamu.” Siloamu mana yaki, Vamlayishili. Kayenda kuyipwembula kuwushu, kawuya kunu palola.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Vandu va pabehi na pala payikalagha na vandu vamumanyili dahili, vayidasha, “Ayu mundu yuyula yayikalagha kunu pavaluva vandu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Vamu vadeta, ayu mweni. Vamu vadeta, “Mweni ha, kayifwana na mweni.”</para>
  <para style="p">Ponopa mweni kadeta, “Nenga ndi mweni yinuveyi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Veni vamudasha, “Mesu vaku vafuwuka wuliwuli?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mweni kayangula, “Mundu yivamkema Yesu kagola mitika, kanshagha mumesu, kang'ombela nyendi ngayipwembuli kuwushu mulitanda lya Siloamu. Nyenda, ndiyipwembula kuwushu tepu nola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vamudasha, “Mundu ayu kava koti?”</para>
  <para style="p">Kavayangula, “Nenga manya ha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Vafwalisayu vakwihola ndambu ya kulowuliwa ngalimesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pambeli vamyegha mundu yula yaghaveyi ngalimesu kwa Mafwalisayu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu lijuva lila lyagoleyi mitika kumgola mundu yula aloli, lyaveli Lijuva lya kupumulila. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mafwalisayu vamudasha kandi, “Kuwesha wuliwuli kulola?”</para>
  <para style="p">Kavayangula, “Kanshagha mitika kumesu, pambeli ndiyipwembula nola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mafwalisayu vamu vawomba, “Mundu ayu yagolili naha kafuma kwa Chapanga ha, kwanongwa kakamula ha Malawu va Lijuva lya kupumulila.”</para>
  <para style="p">Vamonga vadeta, “Akuwesha wuliwuli mundu yavelili na sambi kugola filangushilu kucha afi?” Vamu vatapukili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mafwalisayu vamudasha kandi, “Yuwi ukuwomba yula ghani? Yakugolili uloli.”</para>
  <para style="p">Mweni kavawombela, “Yula mbuyi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Vakomi va Vayawudi vajumilili ng'odu kucha mundu ayu aveli akulola ha pakwandi, ponopa akulola, mbaka pavavakemili valeli vaki. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Veni vavadasha, “Ayu mwana wenu mwamulelili ngajila kulola? Ponopa yiva wuli wuli akuwesha kulola?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Valeli vaki vayangula, “Tumanya kucha ayu mwana wetu, tumlela ngalimesu.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ponopa tumanya ha kucha kawesha wuliwuli kulola, yamgolili aloli tumumanya ha. Mumudashi, mweni kava kala mkomi, akuwesha kuwomba. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Valeli vawombili nawula vavatilili vakomi va Vayawudi, veni valonganili mundu yoyosi yamjumilili Kilistu masiya vandu davamuvingi munyumba ya kudadavila. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa ayi valeli vadeta, “Mumdashi, mweni kava kala mkomi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Vamkema kandi yula yaghaveyi ngalimesu, vamuwombela, “Umupi ukomi Chapanga leki yuwi dawudeti nakaka! Yufwi tumumanya mundu ayu yakulowulili yuwi kana sambi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kavayangula, “Mani kana sambi awu ng'odu, nenga manya ha. Chimanyili nenga chindu chimu hela kucha ngaveli ngalimesu ponopa ngulola!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Veni vamudasha kandi, “Kagola liki kwa yuwi? Kakufuwula wuliwuli mesu vaku?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kavayangula, “Ndivawombela kala mupikanisha ng'odu, kwanongwa liki mkudayila kupikanisha kandi? Yumwi wuwu mkudayila kuva vandundami vaki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Veni vamkalalila, pavadeta, “Yuwi kwa mwanachuli vaki! Yufwi vandundami va Musa! <verse number="29" style="v"/>Tumanya kucha Chapanga amuwombilili Musa, lakini mundu yula yufwi tumanya ng'odu kwafumili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mundu yula kavayangula, “Achi chiloja, yumwi mumanya ng'odu kwafumili, lakini ndi yafuwulili mesu vangu. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yufwi tumanya Chapanga akuvapikanisha ha vala vaveli na sambi, akuvapikanisha vang'alili na vala vampikanisha mweni na kugola chavadayilili kugola. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kufumila ukandi mlima kwa hela mundu, tupikanishili ngalimesu kufumila kuwoneka, kafuwuka mesu vaki. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mundu ayu mani kafuma kwa Chapanga ng'odu, angaweshili ha kugola ngimu wagolili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Veni vayangula naha, “Yuwi kuwonikela na kuleliwa mu sambi, wuliwuli yuwi ukutuwula yufwi?” Vamufumisha panji ya nyumba ya kudadavila.</para>
  <para style="s">Ufuki wa Ngalimesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu apikanishili kucha vamvinga mundu yula panji. Pavatang'anili na mweni kamdasha, “Yuwi ukumjumila Mwana wa mundu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mweni kadasha, “Ghani Bambu? Ung'ombeli nguwesha kumujumila!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu kadeta, “Kumuwona kala, mweni ayu ponopa ukuywanga nayu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mundu yula kadeta, “Ngujumila Bambu.” Pambeli kamtundamila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kadeta, “Nyisa mumlima awu kuhigha, ili vangalimesu valoli na vala yivalola vavi ngalimesu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mafwalisayu vamu vaveli pamu na Yesu, pavapikanishili chadetili, vamudasha, “Nakaka na yufwi ngalimesu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Leki mungaveli vangalimesu, mungaveli na sambi ha, lakini ponopa mkudeta na mkulola, sambi muvanashu.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha mdimi wa vafungami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu avawombilili, “Nakaka nguvawombela, mundu yoyosi yayingila muligeleli lya fungami ngajila kupitila mumlyangu, lakini akwingilila pengi, ayu mwifi na mpoki. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mundu yayingila kwa kupitila pamlyangu ayu nakaka ndi mdimi wa vafungami. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mdima mlyangu akumfuwulila mundoyu na vafungami vakupikanisha lishu lyaki. Na mweni akuvakema vafungami vaki kwa matava vawu na kuvafumisha panji. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mweni pavafumisha vafungami vosi panji, akutangila, vafungami vakumkovikela, nongwa valimanya lishu lyaki. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Davamkovikeli ha mundu wingi, ila mhenja davamtuvi nongwa valimanya ha lishu lyaki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela chilangushilu achi, lakini veni vamanya ha kucha kana mana liki.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi mdimi msangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavawombela kandi, “Nakaka nguvawombela, nenga ndiva mumlyangu wa vafungami. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Vala vamonga vosi yivanonguleli nenga ndi vefi na vapoki na vafungami vavapikanisha ng'odu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nenga ndi mlyangu. Mundu yoyosi yayingila kupitila kwa nenga dalowuliwi. Dayingili na kufuma kusaka filivi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mwifi akwisa kwanongwa ya kuhija, kuwulagha na kuyananga. Nenga nyisa mpati unofu, kandi mukotoo kuyangilwa na chindu chochosi mungalilu yenu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Nenga ndi msangi. Mdimi msangi akusova kwanongwa ya vafungami vaki. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mundu wa ijala, mdimi ha, vafungami vaki ha, pamuwona chingekembi akwisa, akuvaleka vafungami akutuva, pambeli chingekembi akuvakamula vafungami na vakuyaghamila mudasi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mweni akwipwelesha chindu ha kwanongwa ya vafungami, mweni akuwesha kutuva nongwa mweni mundu wa ijala hela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Nenga mdimi msangi. Nguvamanya vafungami vangu na veni vamanya nenga. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kucha Tati wamanyili nenga na nenga ndimumanya Tati. Nenga ngusova kwanongwa ya vafungami vangu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ndiva nawu vafungami vamonga, veni va ligeleli ali ha. Na lasima dandivayeghi wuwula na lishu lyangu davalipikani, pambeli davavi lipinga limu na mdimi yumu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Tati kandama, kwanongwa ayi ngusova pambeli mbati unofu kandi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwahela mundu yang'ushila, ila nenga nguuwusha padayila nimweni, nenga ndiva na uwesu wa kuuwusha na kuuwuyishila kandi. Malawu ava yimbokilili kufuma kwa Tati wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Luyingila kandi lushoshu Vayawudi kwa Vayawudi kwanongwa ya filongu afi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vatangalili vawomba, “Kana chinyamkela, kandi kana lukwali! Wuli mukumpikanisha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Vamu vawomba, “Filongu afi fya mundu munachinyamkela ha, Chinyamkela akuwesha kuvagola vandu vangalimesu mesu, valoli?”</para>
  <para style="s">Vayawudi vakumlema Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kula Yelusalemu kwaveli na lihungu lya kuyihadisha nyumba ya Chapanga Chipindi chila kwaveli na lupepu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu aveli akuyendayenda munyumba ya Chapanga, mumdamwa wa Solumoni. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Topi Vayawudi vamshengeta Yesu, vamudasha, “Dautuleki muchipwembwi mbaka ndili? Tuwombeli kucha yuwi kuva Kilistu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Ndivatovilela, lakini mujumila ha. chichuku achi chigola kwa litawa lya Tati wangu ndi chikundovilela nenga. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yumwi mukujumila ng'odu kwanongwa muva vafungami vangu ha. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Vafungami vakupikana lishu lyangu, nenga ndivamanya, vala vangovikela. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nenga nguvagayila unofu wa jola, veni davayaghamili ng'odu, kwahela mundu danyaghi muliwoku lyangu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Tati wangu yanyimbili ava mkomi kupita vosi, kwahela mundu kandi yawesha kuvanyagha muliwoku lya Tati wa nenga. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nenga na Tati, tuva yumu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Vayawudi vasola miganga vamugumi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Ndivalangusha chichuku sitangalili kufuma kwa Tati. chichuku choti sivavagola yumwi mugumangi miganga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Vayawudi vamuyangula, “Tukukuguma migonguveli kwanongwa ya chichuku chinofu ha, kwanongwa na ukumduka Chapanga! Ukuyigola kuva Chapanga na yuwi kwa mundu hela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Yiyandikiwa mumalawu venu, ‘Chapanga akudeta yumwi muva va Chapanga.’ <verse number="35" style="v"/>Chapanga kavakema vachapanga vala vagayiliwi chilongu chaki, yufwi tumanya kucha Mayandiku Vang'alili vakuwomba nakaka jola. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mweni Tati yamgolili avi Mng'alili na kamulayisha mumlima, yumwi mukumuwombela, akumduka, nongwa adetili, Nenga ndi mwana wa Chapanga? <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mani ngugola fichuku fya Tati wangu ng'odu, topi mukotoo kujumila nenga. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kumbi pandisigola, hata nenga pamujumila ng'odu, ngiba mufijumili fichuku fila figola nenga na kuwona kucha Tati kamugati ya nenga na nenga ndiva mugati ya mweni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Vakacheyi vamkamula lakini kasulubuka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu kayenda kandi kumwambu ya lweni Yoludani, pala Yohani mbatisha pabatisheyi mwanja mtasi, kayikala aku. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Vandu vatangalili vamyendela vawomba, “Yohani mbatisha kagola mihilu yoyonda ha, kumbi fyosi fyadetili Yohani mbatisha filongu fyaki mundu ayu fyaveli nakaka.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Vatangalili vamjumilili Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Njifwa ya Lasalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mundu yumu yivamkema Lasalu, mweni kaya wa Betaniya, alwalili. Betaniya yaveli mlima wayikalagha Maliya pamu na Malita, vahaja mundu Lasalu <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ayu Maliya ndi mweni yamshaghili Bambu mafuta va kunungilila mumawulu na kuvapukuta na fwili shaki. Mhaja mundu Lasalu ndi yaveli akulwala. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Topi vala vahaja mundu valayisha lulayilayi kwa Yesu, vadeta, “Bambu, yula ghanja waku yumtamili kalwala!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu papikanishili, kadeta, “Lasalu asovi kwa utami awu ha, lakini afi figoleka ili ukomi wa Chapanga wuwoneki kwa utami awu na mwana wa Chapanga na mweni ajumiwi.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu avatamili Malita na mhaja mundu na Lasalu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hata naha, papikanishili kucha Lasalu katakwa ayikalili majuva mavili kukula kula ngajila kuyenda kumlola. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pambeli kavawombela vandundami vaki, “Tuyendi kandi Uyawudi!” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Vala vandundami vamuwombela, “Muwula! Mwandi mwandi hela Vayawudi vakakusakeyi vakugumi na miganga kukula kula, yuwi ukudayila kuyenda kandi kuku?” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kayangula, “Saa sha pamusi lilongu na mavili, duhu? Mundu payendayenda pamusi ayikwali ng'odu, nongwa akulola lwengi lwa mulima. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mundu payendayenda pamihi dayikwali, nongwa kavahela lwengi.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu pamalilili kudeta naha, kavawombela, “Ghanja wetu, Lasalu kawonja, lakini nguyenda ngamyimushi.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vanachuli vaki vamuwombela, “Bambu leki pawonja, akunana.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Veni vamanya kucha Yesu kawomba milandu ya kuwonja ng'onju, kumbi kawomba milandu ya njifwa ya Lasalu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela ngatu hela, “Lasalu kasova, <verse number="15" style="v"/>lakini nenga ngusekilela kwanongwa ya yumwi kucha ngaveli aku ha, ili muweshi kujumila. Ponopa tuyendi kwa Lasalu.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Tomasi yivamkema mambila kavawombela vandundami vamonga, “Tuyendi na yufwi tukasovi pamu na mweni!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ushukushu na unofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu pafikili awonili Lasalu vamvikili kala musembi, majuva mchechi vapitili. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Chijiji cha Betaniya chaveli pabehi na Yelusalemu, utali kucha kilomita ndatu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Vayawudi vatangalili vafikili kwa Malita na Maliya kuvakola mawoku kwa chivembu cha mhaja wawu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Malita papikanishili kucha Yesu akwisa, ayendili kumyanga, Maliya asighalili munyumba. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Malita kamuwombela Yesu, “Bambu, kucha ungaveli apa, mhaja wangu angasovili ha! <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lakini ponopa manya kucha fyofyosi fiwudayila kumluva Chapanga dakugayili.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Mhaja waku dashukuki.” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Malita kamyangula, “Manya kucha dashukuki mulijuva lya kushukushiwa.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Nenga ndi awu ushukushu na unofu. Yajumila nenga, hata pasova, dayikali kandi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Na yula yayikala na pajumila nenga, dasovi ha jola, wuli! ukufijumila afi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Malita kamuwombela, “Yina, Bambu! Nenga, ngujumila kucha yuwi ndi Kilistu, mwana wa Chapanga, yula dayisi mumlima.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Malita pamalilili kudeta fila, kayenda kumkema Maliya mkulu mundu, kamuwombela pambali, “muwula kava panji, akukukema.” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mweni papikanishili, kalopu kamukovekela Yesu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu aveli akali hela kuyingila muchijiji, aveli akali hela pahala pala pamuyangilili Malita. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Vala Vayawudi yivaveli pamu na Maliya kayaki, vayisili pala pachivembu pavamuwonili akutandamuka kalopu na kufuma panji vamkovekelili. Vakacheyi akuyenda kusembi akalili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Maliya pafikili pala pavelili Yesu, pamuwonili kamuwila mumawulu, kamuwombela, “Bambu, kucha ungaveli baha mhaja wangu angafwili ha!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu pamuwonili Maliya akulila na vala Vayawudi vayilongushili pamu vakulila, limkola lihingili mundima. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Pambeli kavadasha, “Mumuvika koti?”</para>
  <para style="p">Vamuyangula, “Bambu, wisi loli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu kalila na misosi pwaa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ila Vayawudi vadeta, “Mloli ndambu yamtamili!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Vamu vawomba, “Nakaka! Ayu yamgolili yula ngalimesu aloli, aweshi ng'odu kumgola Lasalu akotoo kusova?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumshukusha Lasalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu yaveli na lusungu mundima yaki, kayenda kusembi. Sembi yeni yaveli mumbaku, yigubikiwa na ligonguveli. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kadeta, “Muliwushi ligonguveli ali!”</para>
  <para style="p">Malita mhaja mundu na yula yasovili kamuwombela, “Bambu, ponopa akununga, kwanongwa kana majuva mchechi tangila asovi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Nenga ngakuwombilili du kucha pamuwujumila damuwuwoni ukomi wa Chapanga?” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Pambeli valiwusha lila ligonguveli. Yesu kalola kumbindi, kawomba, “Ngukuhongesha yuwi Tati nongwa ukumbikanisha. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ngumanya kucha ukumbikana myanja yosi, ng'omba naha kwanongwa ya vandu ava vaveli apa, vaweshi kujumila kucha yuwi ndi yiwunayishili.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Pawombili naha, kakema kwa lishu likomi, “Lasalu! Fumi panji!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Yula yaveli kasova kafuma panji, kunu aveli kana ligubiku mumawulu na mumawoku na kuwushu kawopiwa chitambala. Yesu kavawombela, “Mumuwopoli, mumleki ayiyendeli.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mbedula sha kumuwulagha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:1-5, Maliku 14:1-2, Lukasi 22:1-2</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ponopa Vayawudi vatangalili vaveli pala pa Maliya pavalolili chindu chila chagolili Yesu, vamujumilili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Vamonga vayenda kwa Mafwalisayu vayegha milandu yila yagolili Yesu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Vatambika vakomi na Mafwalisayu vayikalili pa chitemela vagola nongwa ngomi, pavawomba, “Tugoli liki? Mundu ayu akugola filangushilu fitangalili nendu! <figure style="fig" desc="" file="18 Priest.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="11:47">Mtambika wa Chiyawudi</figure> <verse number="48" style="v"/>Patumleka hela vandu vosi davamjumili na veni Valoma davayisi kuyananga Nyumba Ngomi ya Chapanga wetu na mlima wetu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Pala mundu yumu yivamkemili Kayafa, aveli mkomi wa Vatambika mwaka wula, kavawombela, “Yumwi vapufi! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yumwi mumanya ha ngiba mundu yumu asovi kwanongwa ya vandu, pitu vandu va Mlima wonda vasovi?” <verse number="51" style="v"/>Mweni adetili naha kwa kudayila mweni ha kwanongwa mweni aveli mtambika mkomi mwaka wula, topi atungili kucha Yesu dasovi kwanongwa ya vandu va mlima wa Vayawudi. <verse number="52" style="v"/>kwanongwa ya mweni weka hela ha, lakini avakungashili pamu vana va Chapanga yivayitapulili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Kufuma lijuva lila vakomi va Vayawudi vagola milandu ya kumuwulagha Yesu. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Kwanongwa vakacheyi vamkamuli Yesu, mweni katyanga kandi ha mumlima wa Vayawudi, kafuma pala, kayenda pabehi ya lunjenga, mumbwani ya Efelemu. Kayikala aku pamu na vandundami vaki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Lihungu lya Vayawudi lya Pasaka lyaveli pabehi, vandu vatangalili vayenda Yelusalemu kwing'alisha kuliveta lihungu. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Veni vavelili vakumsaka Yesu, pavayikungula munyumba ya Chapanga, vayidasha, “Kucha wuli? Yikuwoneka dayisi ng'odu mulihungu ali?” <verse number="57" style="v"/>Vatambika vakomi pamu na Mafwalisayu valayishili kucha mundu yamanyili paveli Yesu avawombeli ili veni vakamukamuli.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumwayilwa mafuta.</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:6-13, Maliku 14:3-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Majuva sita lihungu lya Pasaka likali, Yesu kayenda Betaniya kwayikaleyi Lasalu, mweni Yesu amshukushili kufuma munjifwa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kula vamgolela filivi fya lumihi, mweni Malita aveli akuvatandila. Lasalu aveli yumu wa vala vavelili pamu na Yesu pamesa vakulya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Maliya atolili nusu lita ya mafuta va kunungilila va nadu vatawukili nendu, kamumwayila Yesu mumawulu, kampukuta na fwili shaki. Nyumba yosi yanungilili mafuta vala. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yudasi Sikaliyoti yaveli yumu wa vandundami va Yesu, mweni damshengeti Yesu, kadeta, <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Ngiba mafuta ava vangahemishili kwa migwala ijala ya myesi tisa na kuvapa migwala ayi vagaju?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Awombili nawula kwa kuvatama vagaju ha, kumbi aveli mwifi. Aveli mvika mbiya na fipindi fitangalili aveli akuhija mbiya mula mumuhaku. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu kadeta, “Mkotoo kumfwasha mawu ayu! Mumuleki agoli kwa lijuva lyangu lya kusikiwa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Vagaju damuvi pamu nawu jola, lakini damuvi na nenga jola ha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mbedula sha kumuwulagha Lasalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Vayawudi vatangalili vapikanili kucha Yesu kava Betaniya. Vayendili kumlola Yesu hela ha wuwula wula vakamloli Lasalu yashukushiwili na Yesu kufuma munjifwa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Vatambika vakomi vagola njila ya kumuwulagha Lasalu wuwula. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa ya Lasalu Vayawudi vatangalili vavalema vakomi vawu, vamjumila Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akwingila Yelusalemu kwa filumbi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 21:1-11, Maliku 11:1-11, Lukasi 19:28-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki, lipinga lya vandu lyayisili mulihungu lya Pasaka vapikanila Yesu kava munjila kwisa Yelusalemu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Vatola mitafya ya mikindu vayenda kumyanga, Pavalandusha kwa kuwomba, “Mumujumi Chapanga! Chapanga munemeli ayu yayisa kwa litawa lya Bambu. Chapanga munemeli mutwa wa Vayisilaeli.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu pambeli kayipaka ngwada wa chihongu kumuwongu, kucha wuvawombili Mayandiku vang'alili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Ukotoo kutila mbwani ya Sayuni!</para>
  <para style="q">Loli mutwa waku akwisa,</para>
  <para style="q2">Kayipaka ngwada wa chihongu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Chipindi chila vandundami vaki vamanyili ha chilongu chila, lakini Yesu pajumiwili kala, vakumbukili chila chiyandikilwi kwa mweni na vandu vamgolela wuwula. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lipinga lya vandu lyaveli pamu na Yesu pala pamkemeyi Lasalu kufuma musembi na kamshukusha kufuma munjifwa, vawombili milandu ya Yesu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lipinga lila lya vandu lyayisili, nongwa vosi vapikanishili kucha Yesu agolili chilangushilu chila. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mafwalisayu vayiwombela, “Mkulola! Datuweshi kugola chindu ha! Mloli mlima wosi ukumkovekela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Vagiliki vamu vakudayila kumuwona Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kwaveli Vagiliki vamu wa vala vafikili Yelusalemu kumluva Chapanga mulijuva lila. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Vala vamyendela Filipu, mwenikaya wa Betisayida kula Galilaya, vawomba, “Bambu, tukudayila kumlola Yesu.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Filipu kayenda, kamuwombela Andeleya, pambeli vosi vavili vayenda kumuwombela Yesu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Saa ya kujumiwa Mwana wa Mundu yifika kala! <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nakaka nguvawombela, ngokwa ya mupunga yikusighala ngokwa hela hata payiponeka pasi pauganga pambeli yikusova. Mani payisova, yikulela fivelekwa fitangalili. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Vala yivautama unofu wawu davawuyaghamishi na vala yivatila ngalilu yau mumlima awu davayangi unofu wa jola. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yadayila kungimbanikila, angovekeli ili pala pandiva nenga na vandumindumi vangu vavi. Tati wangu damtundamili mundu ayu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwomba njifwa yaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Ndima yangu yikalala ponopa ng'ombi liki? Wuli ng'ombi, ‘Tati ukotoo kujumisha chipindi achi mikiwa nenga’? Lakini ayi ndi nongwa yinyisilili ili mbiti muchipindi achi kuteshiwa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Tati, lijumi litawa lyaku.”</para>
  <para style="p">Topi, lishu kufuma kumbindi kwa Chapanga lideta, “Nilijuma kala na danilijumi kandi.” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lipinga lya vandu liwolukili pala lipikanila lishu lila, vamu vawomba, “Kudilima.” Vamu vawomba, “Makungu kaywanga na mweni!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kavawombela, “Lishu ali lipikanika kwanongwa ya nenga ha, lishu ali lipikana kwanongwa ya yumwi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hinapawu chipindi cha mlima awu kuhighiwa, mnakulongosha mlima awu dawushiwi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Na nenga pabikuliwa kumbindi kwa Chapanga mumlima, dandivakweyi vandu vosi kwa nenga.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Adetili nawula kulangusha kucha dasovi kwa njifwa liki. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Topi, lipinga lila limuyangula, “Yufwi tupikanila kufuma mumalawu vetu kucha Kilistu dayikali jola. Dauweshi wuli kuwomba nakaka Mwana wa mundu akudayila kunyasuliwa? Na mwana wa mundoyu ghani?” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Lwengi luva pamu na yumwi kwa chipindi chitali ha. Muyendi yendi kukali na ngesha, ili lwisa lukotoo kuvagubika, kwanongwa yayendayenda mulwisa kamanya ng'odu kwayenda. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Pamuveyi na ngesha mujumili ili muva kala vana va lwengi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Vandu vangajila kujumila</para>
  <para style="p">Pamalilili kudeta filongu fila, Yesu kawuka kayifisa kutali na lipinga lila. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu agolili mihilu yosi pavalola, lakini veni vamjumilili ha, <verse number="38" style="v"/>ili filongu fya detili mbuyi wa Chapanga Isaya ndafiwoneka,</para>
  <para style="q">“Bambu, ghani yajumilili chilongu chetu?</para>
  <para style="q2">Uwesu wa Bambu uwoneka kwa ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Vawesha ha kujumila, kwanongwa Isaya kawomba kandi,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Chapanga kawomba,</para>
  <para style="q">dandivapofoli mesu vawu,</para>
  <para style="q">kavapugha luhala lwawu</para>
  <para style="q">vakotoo kulola kwa mesu vawu,</para>
  <para style="q">na mahala vawu vakotoo kumanya</para>
  <para style="q">vakotoo kung'alambukila nenga, kawomba Bambu,</para>
  <para style="q">ng'weshi kuvagola vanani.” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Isaya ndakawomba filongu afi nongwa kaulola ukomi wa Yesu, kawomba milandu yaki. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Hata naha, vakomi va Vayawudi vatangalili ndavamjumila Yesu, lakini kwanongwa ya Mafwalisayu, vamuyitikila ng'odu pawelu pavatila davalekani na nyumba ya kudadavila ya Vayawudi. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Vadayila ukomi wa vandu pitu kujumiwa na Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kayisa kuulowola mlima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kawomba kwa lishu likomi, “Mundu yajumila nenga, akujumila nenga hela ha, akumjumila na yula yanayishili. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yanola nenga akumlola yula yanayishili wuwula. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Nenga nyisa pamlima kucha lwengi, ili yoyosi yajumili nenga akotoo kuyikala mulwisa. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yangajila kupikana filongu fya nenga, nenga ngumuhigha ha, nongwa nyisa pamlima kuhigha ha, nyisa kuulowola. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yivanema nenga na kukamula ng'odu filongu fyangu vana yumu wakuvahigha. Filongu fila fyang'ombilili dafivi muhigha lijuva lya mwishu. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Ayi nakaka, kwanongwa nenga ng'omba kwa uwesu wa nimweni baha ng'odu, Tati yanayishili ndi mweni yanayishili ng'ombi liki na nywangi liki. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nenga manya kucha lilawu lyaki likuyegha unofu wa jola. Nenga nguwomba fila Tati fyanayishili ng'ombi.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvawofuwa mawulu vandundami vaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yaveli lijuva limu lya Lihungu likali hela kufika. Yesu kamanya kucha saa yaki ya kuwuka pamlima kuyenda kwa Tati yafikili. Avatamili vandu yivaveli vaki va pamlima majuva vosi, avatamili munu!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu pamu na vandundami vaki vayikalili pamu vakulya filivi fya pamihi. Lijangavandu avikili kala mundima ya Yudasi mwana wa Simoni Sikaliyoti, hoshu ya kumushengeta Yesu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu amanyili kucha Tati kamgayila findu fyosi mumawoku vaki na mweni kafuma kwa Chapanga na akuwuya kwa Chapanga. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu kayisegha pafilivi, kakusa yingwa yaki, kayiwopa lukwindu muchiwunu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pambeli kataya machi mungwangu, kakanda kuvawofuva mawulu vandundami vaki kunu pavapukuta na yingwa yafwalili muchiwunu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kayenda paveli Simoni Petili, mweni kawomba, “Bambu yuwi ukung'ofua nenga mawulu?” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu kayangula, “Chila chigola ponopa kuchimanya ha, lakini daumanyi pambeli” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Petili kamuwombela, “Dauweshi kung'ofuwa nenga mawulu vangu hata kamu!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamyangula, “Panguwofuva ng'odu dauvi Lighanja na nenga ha.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Simoni Petili kamyangula Bambu, “Ng'ofuwi, mawulu hela ha pamu na mawoku vangu na mutwi.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Yayovili, kang'ala kala, akudayila kuyova kandi ha ila kunava mawulu hela. Yumwi mung'ala kala ila yumu hela.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu amumanyili kala yula daamushengeti, ndi nongwa awombili naha, “Mwavosi yumwi mung'ala kala, ila yumu hela.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pavawofuwili kala mawulu, kakusumbula yingwa yaki, kayikala pamesa, kavawombela, “Mufimanya fyendivagolili? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yumwi mukungema nenga Muwula na Bambu, yumwi mukuwomba nyanyi nongwa nenga mweni. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nenga muwula na Bambu wenu ndivawofua yumwi mawulu na yumwi mukudayila muyiwofuvi mwaveni mawulu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ndiva gayila chilangushilu, yumwi mugoli kucha wugolili nenga. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nakaka nguvawombela, vavanda vavi vakomi ha kwa vabambu vawu na vanjagila vavi vakomi ha kwa yula yavalayishili. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mani muvamanya ava damuvi na ngiba pamugola. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Afi fing'omba fya mwavosi yumwi ha, nenga ndiva manya vala ndivashawulili. Lakini Mayandiku yivayandikiwili yivawomba, ‘Yula yalili filivi pamu na nenga danshengeti.’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nenga ndivawombela filongu afi, fikali kufumbuka ponopa, fifumbuka muweshi kujumila kucha nenga ndi mweni. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nakaka nguvawombela, yamupokela yula yindimulayishili akumbokela nenga na yula yambokela nenga akumpokela yula yanayishili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kadeta milandu ya kumushengeta mweni</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:20-25, Maliku 14:17-21, Lukasi 22:21-23</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu pawombili filongu fila, ndima yimutama nendu kadeta, “Nakaka nguvawombela muyenu yumu dashengeti!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vandundami vayilola veni kwa veni, vamanya ha akumuwomba ghani. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Paveli na ndundami yumu Yesu yamtamili aveli kayikala pambali yaki. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Simoni Petili akamukupisheyi kwa mawoku pawomba, “Mudashi akumudeta ghani?” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ndundami yula kaselela pabehi na Yesu kamudasha, “Bambu ghani ayu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu kayangula, “Yula yindimupa chipandi cha libumunda chinikishilili ndi mweni. Pambeli katola chipandi cha libumunda kalikishila, kamupa Yudasi mwana wa Simoni Sikaliyoti.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yuda patolili libumunda lila, tepu, Lijangavandu limwingila. Yesu kamuwombela, “Chiwudayila kugola goli kalopu.” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kwa hela mundu yayikalili pamesa yamanyili kucha wuli kamuwombela wula. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yudasi aveli mkola mbiya, vamu vamanyili kucha Yesu akumuwombela mweni akahemeli findu fya lihungu awu kuvagayila vagaju findu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Tepu hela Yuda payangili hela libumunda lila, kafuma panji. Ndayiva pamihi.</para>
  <para style="s">Lilawu lya shonu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yuda pawukili kala, Yesu kawomba, “Topi ukomi wa Mwana wa Mundu wukuwoneka, ponopa ukomi wa Chapanga akuwoneka kupitila mweni. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kucha ukomi wa Chapanga ukuwoneka kupitila mweni, topi mweni Chapanga dagoli ukomi wa Mwana wa Mundu wuwoneki, tepu dagoli afi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Vana vangu dandivi na yumwi padokwa, damunzaki, kucha ndivawombilili Vayawudi, nguvawombela ponopa, ‘Kunyenda, damufiki ha.’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lilawu lya shonu nguvagayila, muyitami yumwi kwa yumwi, kucha ndivadayilili nenga, ponopa muyitami yumwi kwa yumwi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Naha vandu vosi davamanyi kucha yumwi muva vandundami va nenga, mani mkuyitama yumwi kwa yumwi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kadeta kucha Petili damulemi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:31-35, Maliku 14:27-31, Lukasi 22:31-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Simoni Petili kamudasha, “Bambu, ukuyenda koti?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamuyangula, “Kunyenda nenga dauweshi kungovekela ha. Dawungovikeli pambeli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Petili kadasha, “Bambu, wuli nenga dangweshi ng'odu kukukovikela ponopa? Nenga danyasi unofu wangu kwanongwa ya yuwi.” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kamyangula, “Nakaka yuwi daumalili unofu waku kwanongwa ya nenga? Nakaka nguvawombela kandi njowolu akali kuvika yuwi daunemi nenga myanja mitatu!”</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi Deha ya kuyenda kwa Tati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Mkotoo kuyipwelesha kunda yenu, leki mukumjumila Chapanga, mujumili na nenga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Munyumba ya Tati wangu muna fyumbagati fitangalili, kungaveli hela fwasi ya kuyikala ningavawombilili ha, nguyenda ngavatandili pa kuyikala. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Topi pandivatandila kala pakwikala, danyisi kandi kuvatola ili pandiva nenga na yumwi muvi baha. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yumwi mwiyimanya deha yinyendela aku kunyenda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Tomasi kamudasha, “Bambu, yufwi tumanya ha kuwuyenda, ponopa datwimanyi wuli wuli deha?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu kayangula, “Nenga ndi nakaka na deha na unofu, kwa hela mundu yayenda kwa Tati ngajila kupitila kwa nenga. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nongwa mungamanyili nenga, mungamumanyili na Tati wangu. Kukandila ponopa mumumanya na mumuwona kala.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Filipu kamuwombela, “Bambu, yufwi tukudayila utulangushi Tati hela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kamuyangula, “Filipu, mumanya ng'odu nenga? Ndiyikala na yumwi majuva vatangalili. Yang'onili nenga kamuwona na Tati. Topi, nongwa liki mukudeta, ‘ndivalangushi Tati?’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yuwi ukujumila ng'odu kucha nenga ndiva mugati ya Tati na Tati kava mugati ya nenga?” Yesu kavawombela, ngudeta kwa liwovi lyangu ha, ila Tati yayikala mugati ya nenga ndi ya gola chichuku chaki. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mujumili nenga padeta kucha ndiva mugati ya Tati na Tati kava mugati ya nenga. Leki mukujumila ng'odu nenga, mujumili kwanongwa ya fila figola. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nakaka nguvawombela, yula ya jumila nenga, dagoli fichuku fila figola, dagoli findu fikomi kupita afi, kwanongwa nenga nguwuka nguyenda kwa Tati. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nenga dagoli chochosi chimudayila kuluva kwa litawa lyangu, ili Tati ajumiwi kwa njila ya mwana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Leki pamuluva chindu chochosi kwa kutambula litawa lyangu, nenga dagoli.</para>
  <para style="s">Ulayilayi wa Mfuki Mng'alili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Leki mundama nenga, damukamuli Malawu vangu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Na nenga dandimuluvi Tati, mweni avapi Mtangi wingi ayikali na yumwi jola. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mweni ndi Mfuki wulangusha unakaka wa Chapanga, vandu va mlima awu davaweshi ha kumujumila kwanongwa vamuwona ha na vamumanya ha. Lakini yumwi mumumanya, kwanongwa kava na yumwi na akwikala mugati ya yumwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Danivaleki ng'odu kucha Valekwa, dandivawuyili kandi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Chisighala chipindi chidokwa vandu va mlima awu davang'oni kandi ha. Lakini yumwi damung'oni, kwanongwa nenga munofu na yumwi damuvi vanofu wuwula wula. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lijuva palifika damumanyi kucha nenga ndiva mugati ya Tati wangu na yumwi muva mugati ya nenga na nenga ndiva mugati ya yumwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Vandu vakamula Malawu va nenga na kuvajumila, ava vakundama. Na Tati wangu davatami vala yivandama nenga na nenga dandivatami wuwula wula na nenga dandiyilangushi kwa veni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yuda wingi Sikaliyoti ha, kamudasha, “Bambu, wuli wuli dawiyilangusha umweni kwa yufwi, ngajila kuyilangusha kwa vandu va mlima awu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kamuyangula, “Yandama nenga dakamuli mawuli vangu. Tati wangu damutami, Tati pamu na nenga datuyingili mugati yaki na kuyikala. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yandama ng'odu, akukamula ha filongu fyangu na filongu fimupikana padeta fikufuma kwa nenga ha, filongu fya Tati wangu yanayishili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Afi ndi finivawombeleyi pandiyikaleyi na yumwi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Lakini Mtangi, ndi Mfuki Mng'alili, Tati damulayishi kwa litawa lyangu, davawuli findu fyosi, kuvakumbushila fyosi findivawombilili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Nguvalekela kusika, nguvapa kusika kwa nenga. Kusika kundivavapa nenga kuva ng'odu kucha ngimu mlima wuvavapa yumwi. Mkotoo kuyipwelesha wala mukotoo kutila. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mumbikanisha pandivawombilili kucha, ‘Nguyenda pambeli nguwuya kandi.’ Leki mungandamili mungasekilili kucha nguyenda kwa Tati, nongwa Tati mkomi pitu nenga. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ndivawombela filongu afi ngengi, ili pafibwituka mujumili. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Danywangi na yumwi filongu fitangalili ha, kwanongwa mtavala wa mlima awu akwisa, mweni kwa nenga kana liwovi ha, <verse number="31" style="v"/>lakini ili mlima umanyi kucha ngumutama Tati na ngugola findu fyosi kucha mweni wanayishili.</para>
  <para style="p">“Muwoloki, tuwuki apa.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu msabibu wa nakaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Nenga ndi msabibu nakaka, Tati wangu mulimi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mweni akudumula litafi lingajila kulela fivelekwa na kuliyasa na akulihengelela lila litafi lilela ili lileli fivelekwa fitangalili. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yumwi muva nyanyi kala kwanongwa mukamula chilongu chila chindivawombilili. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Muyikali mugati ya nenga na nenga dandiyikali mugati ya yumwi. Litafi weka hela lileli ha fivelekwa mbaka livi mulibiki lyaki lya musabibu. Wuwula wula yumwi muleli ha fivelekwa ila pamuva mugati ya nenga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Nenga ndiva lihadiki lya lisabibu na yumwi muva mitafyi, yiyikala mugati ya nenga na nenga nguyikala mugati yaki na akulela fivelekwa fitangalili, kwanongwa pangajila nenga mukuwesha ha kugola chindu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mumuleki mundu yayikala ng'odu mugati ya nenga, ayu akuva kucha litafi liyasiwili na kuyuma, mitafi yiyumili yikungiwa na kuyasiwa mumotu, dayilunguli nigu! <verse number="7" style="v"/>Leki mkuyikala mugati ya nenga na filongu fyangu dafiyikali mugati ya yumwi, damuluvi chochosi chimudayila damugayiliwi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Leki pamulela fivelekwa fitangalili, Tati wangu dajumiwi nakaka damuvi vandundami vangu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kucha wula Tati pandamili nenga, wuwula wula nenga ndivatama yumwi, muyikali muwutami wa nenga. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pamuvakamula Malawu vangu, yumwi damuyikali muwutami wangu, kucha nenga wundivakamulili Malawu va Tati wangu na nguyikala muwutami waki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Ndavawombilili naha ili sekelelu yangu yivi mugati yenu na sekuseku yenu yimemi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lilawu lyangu ndi ali: muyitami yumwi kwa yumwi kucha nenga wundivatama yumwi <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kwahela mundu yaveli na utami kucha awu, wa kuuleka unofu waki kwanongwa ya vaghanja vaki. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yumwi muva vaghanja vangu mani mkugola fila fyindivalayishili. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Dandivakemi ng'odu vandumindumi kandi, kwanongwa vandumindumi vamanya ng'odu fyagola bambu wawu. Lakini yumwi ndivakema vaghanja, kwanongwa fyosi findifipikanilili kwa Tati ndivawombela. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yumwi munshawula nenga ng'odu, nenga ndivashawula yumwi na ndivalayisha yumwi, muyendi mukaleli nendu fivelekwa fya kuyikala. Na Tati davavapi chindu chochosi chimumuluva mulitawa lyangu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nguvawombela naha yumwi, muyitami yumwi kwa yumwi.</para>
  <para style="s">Lihingili lya mlima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Leki vandu va mlima pavavakalalila yumwi, muyiholi kucha vangalalili nenga tanila. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Leki mungaveli vandu va mlima awu, vangavatamili yumwi kucha veni. Lakini yumwi wa mlima awu ng'odu, nongwa nenga ndivashawula kufuma mumlima awu, kwanongwa ayi vandu va mlima awu vakuvakalalila yumwi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Muyiholi wundivawombilili kucha kwahela vavanda yivaveli vakomi kwa Bambu wawu. Leki vandeshili nenga, davavateshi na yumwi wuwula wula. Leki vavakamulili mawuli va nenga, davakamuli na va yumwi wuwula wula. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lakini davavagoleli fyosi kwanongwa yumwi muva va nenga, veni vamanya ng'odu mweni yanyeghili. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Leki ngayisili na kuwomba na veni ng'odu, vangaveli na sambi ng'odu, ponopa vavahela cha kuyitasha sambi shawu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yula yangalalila nenga akumkalalila Tati wangu wuwula wula. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mani ngagolili ng'odu fichuku fila kwahela mundu angagolili na vangaveli na sambi ha. Ponopa vayiwona mihilu yigolili, lakini vangalalila nenga na Tati wangu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lakini fyosi afi fidayiliwa kugoleka ili Malawu vavi nakaka, ‘Vangalalila nenga ngajila nongwa.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Leki payisa ayu Mtangi, yindivayeghela kufuma kwa Tati, ayu Yang'alili nakaka kufuma kwa Tati, mweni dandovileli nenga. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Na yumwi wuwula wula damundovileli nenga, kwanongwa tuva pamu kufumila pakwandi.”</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Ndivawombela naha ili mukotoki kuleka ujumilu wenu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Davavavingi munyumba shawu sha Chapanga, chipindi chikwisa chila kila mundu yavawulaya daamanyi akumuwushila Chapanga litambiku. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Vandu davagoli naha nongwa vamumanya ng'odu Tati na nenga. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ndivawombela filongu afi, ili chipindi pachifika muvi na ngumbungumbu kucha ndivawombilili kala.</para>
  <para style="s">Fichuku fya Mfuki Mng'alili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Ponopa nguyenda kwa mweni yanayishili, lakini kwahela mundu yadasha nguyenda koti. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ndivawombela naha, mundima shenu mumema ligafugafu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lakini ndivawombela nakaka, finofu kwa yumwi nenga kuwuka, kwanongwa nenga pang'uka ng'odu, dayisi ha Mtangi, ila pang'uka, dandimulayishi kwa yumwi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mweni payisa, davamanyishi vandu va pamlima milandu kucha vatoshangila milandu ya sambi na ugoleki na fiyilatili highilu ya Chapanga. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Vatoshangila milandu ya sambi, kwanongwa vajumila ng'odu nenga, <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwilata ugoleki kwanongwa nenga nguyenda kwa Tati, damung'oni kandi ha, <verse number="11" style="v"/>vatoshangila mumilandu ya kuhigha, nongwa Lijangavandu mkomi wa mlima awu kahighiwa kala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Ngali na filongu fitangalili fya kuvawombela, lakini dafivi vitangalili munu kwa yumwi kufikamula fyosi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Topi payisa Mfuki mweni, ayu ndi yalangusha unakaka wa Chapanga, davalongoshi muunakaka wosi, mweni davawombeli kwa uwesu waki mweni lakini davawombeli fyapikanila na fila dafiyisi kuwulongolu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mweni dajumi nenga, nongwa datoli fyang'ombilili avawombeli yumwi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Fyosi fya Tati wangu fya nenga, ndi nongwa ndawombili Mfuki Mng'alili datoli fila fyindimugayilili avawombeli yumwi.</para>
  <para style="s">Ngalasi na seku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Yikali chipindi chidokwa hela damung'oni ha, pambeli padokwa damung'oni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Vandundami vaki vamu vayikanganikili, “Afi fya detili fina mana liki? Kutuwombela chisighala chipindi chidokwa datumuwoni ha na kudeta, ‘Samba kawuka, samba kawuya na akuyenda kwa Tati.’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Vasiyala vakwidasha, ‘Chilongu liki achi chawomba?’ Tumanya ha chawomba.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kamanya kucha vadayila kumdasha, topi kavawombela, “Chimwidasha liki kucha ng'omba, samba ndivaleka damung'oni ha pambeli samba mung'ona. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nakaka nguvawombela, yumwi damulili kunu pamu yidedeka, topi, mlima dausekeleli, yumwi damukalali, kukalala kwa yumwi dakughalambuki cheleli buja. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mdala palela, kana lihingili nongwa saa yaki yifika ya kulela, leki palela mwana, akwivasuwa lila lihingili lya kulela kwanongwa ya cheleli. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Na yumwi wuwula, muna lung'ong'u, lakini nenga dandang'aniki na yumwi kandi, yumwi damumemi cheleli buja mumunda shyenu, kwahela yawesha kuvawushila seku shyenu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mulijuva lila damungonyi chindu ng'odu. Nakaka nguvawombela, Tati wa nenga davagayili chila chimumluva kwa litawa lyangu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mbaka ponopa munuva ng'odu chindu chochosi mulitawa lyangu. Muluvi, damupati, kusekelela kwa yumwi kuvi jola.</para>
  <para style="s">Ndiwuwesha kala Mlima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Ng'omba kwa ng'ombelu ya kuyifwana na yumwi, kuvawombela milandu ayi. Saa yikwisa nenga danywangi kwa kuyifwana ha, dang'ombi lipala hela milandu ya Tati. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mulijuva lila damuluvi kwa kupitila litawa lyangu, ngudeta ha kucha nenga dandivaluvili kwa Tati, <verse number="27" style="v"/>Tati mweni kavatama yumwi. Kavatama yumwi kwanongwa mundama nenga na mujumila kucha nenga fuma kwa Chapanga. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Fuma kwa Tati, nyisa mumlima, ponopa nguwuleka mlima nguwuya kwa Tati wangu.” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Pambeli vandundami vaki vamuwombela, “Ponopa ukuwomba lipala, ukudeta lipala ngajila chifisu mung'ombelu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Tumanya kucha yuwi kumanya milandu yosi kwahela mundu wa kukudasha naha tujumila kucha yuwi kufuma kwa chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Ponopa mukujumila? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Dachisi chipindi na chiva kala, mwavosi damulekanili kila mundu na kaya yaki, damuneki weka, lakini nguva weka ha kwanongwa Tati wangu kava na nenga. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ndivawombela naha ili yumwi muvi na kusika pamuva pamu na nenga. Vandu vamlima davavagoboli lakini mudindali! Mlima ndiwuwesha kala.”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvadadavila vandundami vaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu pamalilili kuwomba naha, kalola kumbindi kunu pawomba, “Tati chipindi chiyisa. Uvagoli vandu vamujumi mwana waku, ili mwana waku akujumi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wamugayilili uwesu kupita vandu vosi, ili avagayili unofu wa jola vosi vala wamugayilili. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Unofu wa jola ndi awu, kukumanya yuwi weka Chapanga wa nakaka na kumumanya Yesu Kilistu, yula yumulayishili. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nenga ndiwulangusha ukomi waku apa pamlima, malila fichuku fiwunyimbili ndifigoli. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Tati! Unyimbi ukomi pawulongolu paku ponopa, ukomi wuwula wula ndaveli nawu pamu na yuwi chipindi mlima waveli wakali hela kuva.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Ndikugola umanyiki kwa vandu vala vawunyimbili mumlima. Vaveli vandu vaku na yuwi wanyimbili nenga. Vachikamula chilongu chaku, <verse number="7" style="v"/>ponopa vamanya kucha fyosi fiwungayilili fifuma kwa yuwi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Topi filongu fiwungayilili ndivagayila veni na veni vafipokela. Nakaka vamanya kucha fuma kwa yuwi. Vajumila kucha yuwi kunayisha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Nenga nguvadadavila vala, nguvadadavila ha vandu vosi va pamlima, nguvadadavila hela vala vawunyimbili, nongwa veni vandu va yuwi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Fyosi fimeli nafyu fya yuwi na fyosi fiwuveli nafyu fya nenga. Ukomi kupitila ava. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nenga ndiva kandi mumlima ha, veni vakali mumlima. Na nenga ngwisa kwa yuwi. Tati Mng'alili, uvadimi vandu kwa liwovi lya litawa lyaku liwugayilili, ili vosi vavi yumu kucha yufwi wutuveli yumu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pandiveyi na veni, ndivadima na kuvavika panofu kwa liwovi lya litawa lyaku, litawa liwunyimbili. Kwa hela hata yumu yayaghamilili ila yumu hela yula yalatiwili kuyaghamila ili Mayandiku vavi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Ponopa ngwisa kwa yuwi, filongu afi nda detili chipindi ndaveli ngali ndiva pamlima, ili veni vavi na sekuseku lumemili mundima shawu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ndivagayila chilongu chaku na vandu va mlima awu vavakalalila nongwa veni va mlima awu ha, kucha nenga wa mlima awu ha. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nenga ngudadava ha kucha uvawushi mumlima awu, lakini nguluva uvadimi na yula Mwafu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nenga wamlima awu ng'odu na veni wuwula wula wa mlima awu ha. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Uvagoli vavi vaku kwa nakaka yaku, chilongu chaku ndi nakaka. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kucha yuwi wuunayishili nenga mumlima, wuwula wula na nenga nguvalayisha veni mumlima. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa ya veni, ndiyitawula nimweni kwa yuwi ili na veni wuvagoli kuva vaku nakaka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Nguvadadavila veni weka ha. Nguvadadavila na vala yivajumila nenga kwanongwa ya chilongu chawu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Tati, ngudadava vosi vavi yumu, kucha yuwi wuveli mugati ya nenga na nenga mugati ya yuwi. Na veni vavi mugati ya yufwi, ili mlima ujumili kucha yuwi ndi wanayishili. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ndivagayila ukomi wula wuunyimbili nenga, ili vavi yumu kucha wula yufwi wutuveli yumu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nenga mugati ya veni na yuwi mugati ya nenga, vavi yumu nakaka, ili mlima umanyi kucha wanayishili na ukuvatama veni kucha wula wundamili nenga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Tati, vala vaungayilili ngudayila vavi pamu na nenga kosi pandiva, vaweshi kuulola ukomi wa nenga, ukomi wuunyimbili kwanongwa wandamili chipindi mlima ukali hela kugoleka. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Tati goleki, Mlima wukumanya ng'odu, lakini nenga ngumanya na veni vamanya kucha yuwi wanayishili. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ngukugola umanyiki kwa veni na danyendileli kugola nahawu, ili utami wuveli nawu kwa nenga wuvi na kwa veni, ili ndivi mugati yawu.”</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kuvakuliwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:47-56, Maliku 14:43-50, Lukasi 22:47-53</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu pamalili kudadava, kawuka pamu na vandundami vaki vayenda kumwambu ya lweni Keduloni. Paveli na chiwunga cha mibiki kayingila mweni pamu na vandundami vaki. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mweni Yudasi, yadayileyi kumushengeta Yesu, kapamanya pala, kula Yesu kwayendili na vandundami vaki. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yudasi kayenda kuchiwunga cha mibiki, aveli pamu na chipinga cha machonda, pamu na vandumindumi kufuma kwa vakomi va vatambika na Mafwalisayu, vayenda na lung'ali na niku pamu na fidumu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu kamanya kala fyosi dafimfumbukili, kawoloka paulongolu kavadasha, “Mkumsaka ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Veni vayangula, “Yesu Mnasaleti”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kavayangula, “Nenga ndi mweni.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yudasi yamshengetili kawoloka pamu na vala. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu pavawombilili, “Nenga ndi mweni” Vatatalikili kumbeli, vawa pasi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kavadasha kandi, “Mkumsaka ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Vamyangula, “Yesu Mnasaleti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula kandi, “Ndiva wombela kala nenga ndi mweni. Leki mukunsaka nenga, muvaleki ava vayendi.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Awombili naha ili fyadetili fivi nakaka. “Tati vala vawungayilili ndimuyamishi hata yumu ha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Simoni Petili aveli na lipanga, kalifyangula, kamtova ndumindumi wa Mtambika mkomi, kamdumula lijeji lya kumlilu. Yula ndumindumi litawa lyaki Malikusi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kamuwombela Petili, “Wuyishi lipanga lyaku muhala! Ukudayila lwindi lwa kuteshiwa lwanyimbili Tati wangu ndilulandili ng'odu?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamuyegha kwa Anasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pambeli vala machonda na mkomi wau na vala vandumindumi va Vayawudi vamkamula Yesu, vamuwopa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Vamtola mbaka kwa Anasi. Anasi kava mkohanu mundu na Kayafa, yula yaveli mtambika mkomi mwaka wula. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mweni Kayafa avagayilili vakomi va Vayawudi chilongu kucha ngiba, mundu yumu asovi kwanongwa ya vosi.</para>
  <para style="s">Petili akumlema Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:69-70, Maliku 14:66-68, Lukasi 22:55-57</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Simoni Petili na ndundami wingi vamkovekela Yesu. Ayu ndundami kamanyika nendu na mtambika mkomi, kayingila pamu na Yesu muwudamwa wa mtambika mkomi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Petili paghaveyi panji ya mlyangu. Ndundami yumu yamanyikili na mtambika mkomi kafuma panji kumuwombela yula mdala wa pamlyangu amuyeghi Petili munyumba. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mdala yula wa pamlyangu kamuwombela Petili, “Yuwi kuva ndundami yumu wa mundu yula?”</para>
  <para style="p">Mweni kawomba, “Nenga ng'odu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwavelili na lupepu, vandumindumi na vamachonda va boma vaveli vakosha motu wa makala vakuyota. Petili na mweni aveli vakuyota pamu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mtambika mkomi akumdasha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:59-66, Maliku 14:55-64, Lukasi 22:66-71</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mtambika mkomi amdashili Yesu milandu ya vandundami vaki pamu na mawuli vaki. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Nenga ng'omba na vandu va mlima awu lipala hela kwa kila mundu, mawuli vangu vosi ndivagola munyumba sha Chapanga na Nyumba ya kudadavila, pala Vayawudi vosi vakwikungula. Wala ng'omba chindu chochosi. Mulufisu ha. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Wuli mukudasha nenga? Mukavadashi vandu yivambikanishili nenga. Nakaka vamanya chila ching'ombili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pawombili kala afi, ndumindumi yumu yawolukili pabehi na Yesu kamvanga mbandi kunu pawomba, “Wuli ukuwomba naha kwa mtambika mkomi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Mani ng'omba wafu, unangushi wafu weni, mani ng'omba kwanongwa mukundovela liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pambeli Anasi kamuyegha Yesu akali kawopiwa kwa Kayafa mtambika mkomi.</para>
  <para style="s">Petili akumlema kandi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:71-75, Maliku 14:69-72, Lukasi 22:58-62</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Simoni Petili aveli kawoloka akuyota motu, vamdasha “Na yuwi kwa ndundami wa mundu yula ng'odu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petili kayangula, “Ng'odu, nenga ndili!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ndumindumi yumu wa mtambika mkomi na yula Simoni Petili amdumulili lijeji, kawomba, “Nenga ndikuwona ng'odu yuwi kula kuchiwunga cha mibiki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Petili kakana kandi, tepu njowolu kavika.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu paulongolu ya Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:71-75, Maliku 14:69-72, Lukasi 22:58-62</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Pambeli pamalavila putiputi vamtola Yesu kufuma kwa Kayafa vamuyegha kunyumba ya mkomi wa mkowa wa Yudeya. Vakomi va Vayawudi vayingila ng'odu kwanongwa vakotoo kuva vandu va wafu ili vakotoo kulya lihungu lya Pasaka. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Topi, Pilatu kafuma pangi kavadasha, “Mukumuhighila liki mundu ayu yimumuyeghili?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Vamuyangula, “Mani angaveli mwafu ng'odu tunga muyeghili kwa yuwi ha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pilatu kavawombela, “Topi mumtoli yumwi mkamuhighi kwa Malawu venu.” Vayawudi vamuyangula, “Yufwi tuvahela uwesu wa kumuhigha njifwa mundu yoyosi.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ili chilongu cha wombili Yesu chigoleki kulangusha kucha dasovi wuli wuli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Pilatu kayingila munyumba mwaveli Yesu, kamdasha, “Yuwi kwa mutwa wa Vayawudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kamuyangula, “Filongu afi fya umweni baha awu vakuwombela vandu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Pilatu kamuyangula, “Nenga ndiva Muyawudi? Vandu vaku na vatambika vakomi vakuyegha kwa nenga. Kugola liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu kawomba, “Wutwa wangu wa mlima awu ha, mani ungaveli wa mlima awu vandumindumi vangu vanganevanilili ngotoo kutayiwa mumawoku va Vayawudi. Topi wutwa wangu wa mahali pengi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pilatu kamudasha, “Yuwi kuva mutwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">Pambeli Yesu kamyangula, “Yuwi ukudeta nenga Mutwa. Ndawonikili na kwisa kumlima kwanongwa ayi, tudeti unakaka. Mundu yawutama unakaka, akumbikana nenga.” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Pilatu kamudasha, “Nakaka ndi liki?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuhighiwa njifwa</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 27:15-31, Maliku 15:6-20, Lukasi 23:13-25</para>
  <para style="p">Pawombili chilongu chila, kavafumbukila kandi Vayawudi padeta, “Nenga nguwona ng'odu wafu kwa mundu ayu. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kwa yumwi kuna chishovi cha kumfuwulila yumu kufuma muchijaka chipindi cha Lihungu, ponopa nenga ndivafuwulili mutwa wa Vayawudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Vawuta kandi kwa lishu likomi, “Ayu ha, tukumdayila Balaba.” Balaba aveli mpoki kwa vandu.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu vakumuhigha kuvangiliwa mulupingika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pambeli Pilatu kamuyegha Yesu vamutovi ndomondu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Veni vamachonda vapota likokoma lya misomi vamufwalisha Yesu kumutwi, kandi vamufwalisha yingwa ya wutwa, <verse number="3" style="v"/>vamyendela pavamuwombela, “Hasi, mutwa wa Vayawudi!” Vamutova mbandi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pambeli Pilatu kafuma kandi panji kavawombela, “Mumuloli mundu ayu yindimuyegha panji kwa yumwi mumanyi kucha nenga nguwuwona ha wafu wa mundu ayu.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu kafuma pangi, kafwala lila likokoma lya misomi na yingwa ya chiwutwa. Pilatu kavawombela, “Mumloli mundu ayu.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Vatambika vakomi pamu na vamachonda va Nyumba ya kudadavila pavamuwonili vadeta kwa lishu likomi, “Muvangilili mulupingika, muvangilili mulupingika!”</para>
  <para style="p">Pilatu kavawombela, “Mumtoli mwaveni baha mumuvangilili mulupingika, nenga nguuwona ha wafu waki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vayawudi vamuyangula, “Yufwi tuva na Malawu vetu, mumalawu ava akudayilwa kusova, nongwa kayigola kucha mweni Mwana wa Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pilatu papikinili chilongu chila, katila nesu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kayingila kandi munyumba ya mkomi wa mkowa wa Yudeya, kamudasha Yesu, “Yuwi kufuma koti?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamyangula ha. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pilatu kamuwombela, “Yuwi ukudeta ng'odu na nenga? Kumanya ha kucha nenga ndiva na uwesu wa kukufuwulila awu kukuvangilila mulupingika?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu kamyangula, “Yuwi ungaveli kwahela uwesu kwa nenga mani ungapatili ng'odu kufuma kumbindi kwa Chapanga. Topi mweni yangamulili kunyegha kwa yuwi kana sambi ngomi nendu.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Topi papikinili naha Pilatu akasakeyi njila ya kumlekesa Yesu, Vayawudi vamuwutila, “Mani pawumlekesela ayu, yuwi kuva lighanja ha na Mutwa wa Loma. Mundu mweni yayigola mutwa ayu akumvifya Mutwa wa Loma!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Topi, Pilatu pakapikinishili naha, kamfumisha Yesu panji, kayikala muchiti cha kuhighila, pala pavapakema Sakafu ya Migonguveli, kwa chibulaniya, “Gabata” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yaveli pabehi na lijuva lya pasaka na mkengi waveli palundosi, lijuva lya kutanda Lihungu. Kavawombela Vayawudi, “Ayu mutwa wa yumwi”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Vadetili kwa lishu likomi, “Muwulayi! Muwulayi! Muvangilili mulupingika!”</para>
  <para style="p">Pilatu kavawombela, “Yumwi mudayila nenga ndimuvangililii mulupingika mutwa wa yumwi?” Vatambika vakomi vayangula, “Tuva hela Mutwa wingi ila mutwa wa Loma weka hela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pambeli Pilatu kavagayila Yesu kwa veni vamuvangilili mulupingika.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvangiliwa mulupingika</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 27:32-44, Maliku 1:21-32, Lukasi 23:26-43</para>
  <para style="p">Topi, vamtola Yesu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kafuma kunu katola lupingika lwaki mweni kayenda pala pavakema Lipava lya Mutwi. Pavapakemili Goligota kwa Chibulaniya. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Vamuvangilila mulupingika kula na pavelili vandu vavili vavangiliwili mulupingika pamu na Yesu, yumu mwambu wa mlilu na wingi mwambu wa mkiyi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mweni Pilatu kayandika pachibawu kachivangilila pa lupingika, kayandika, “Yesu wa Nasaleti Mutwa wa Vayawudi.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vayawudi vatangalili vasoma, nongwa pala Yesu pavamuvangilili mulupingika pavelili pabehi na mbwani kandi vayandika kwa Chibulaniya, Chilatini pamu na Chigiliki. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Vatambika vakomi na Vayawudi vamuwombela Pilatu, “Ukotoo kuyandika mutwa wa Vayawudi, topi mundu ayu awombili mweni mutwa wa Vayawudi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pilatu kavayangula, “Chinyandikili, nyandika.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Vala vamachonda pavamalilili kumuvangilila mulupingika Yesu, vatola yingwa shaki, vavaghana filepa mchechi, kila machonda chilepa chimu na lihabiti lingajila kusonewa vatolili. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Vayiwombela veni, “Tukotoo kuyidemula, tuyigoleli do ili ghani atoli.” Chilongu achi chagolikili ili mayandiku vang'alili vavi,</para>
  <para style="q">“Vavaghana yingwa shangu veni kwa veni.</para>
  <para style="q">Vavaghana yingwa shangu kwa kugola do”</para>
  <para style="m">Nahawu ndi wuvagolili vamachonda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pabehi na lupingika lwa Yesu vaveli vawoloka mawu wa Yesu na mkulumundu na Maliya mdala wa Kilopa, pamu na Maliya Magadalena. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu pamuwonili mawu waki na ndundami yumu yamtamili kawoloka pabehi, kamuwombela mawu waki, “Mawu ayu mwana waku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pambeli kamuwombela yula ndundami, “Ayu mawaku.” Kufuma pala ndundami yula kamtola mawu yula kayaki.</para>
  <para style="s">Njifwa ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 27:45-56, Maliku 1:33-41, Lukasi 23:44-49</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kamanya kucha fyosi fyavelili kala, ili Mayandiku Mang'alili vavi, kadeta “Nguwona nyumilwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Pala paveli na chindu, vataya siki pambeli vajabika lindelindeli vavika muluteti vamsofusha. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Payangili yila siki, Yesu kadeta “Yipela.”</para>
  <para style="p">Pambeli kagondamisha mutwi kasova.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamusoma lisala palubafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pambeli vakomi va Vayawudi vamuluva Pilatu avajumishi kugojola mawulu va vala vavangiliwili mulupingika na kusunusha fikongu fyawu pasi kufuma mulupingika. Vagolili naha kwanongwa yaveli lijuva lya Ijuma lyaveli lijuva lya kutandila Lijuva lya kupumulila na vadayilili ng'odu mivili ya vandu vala yikali kumbindi ya lupingika lijuva lila, kwanongwa Lijuva lila lyaveli Lijuva lya kupumulila. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Machonda vayisa vamgojola miwulu wa kwaa na wingi yumu wa vala yavangiliwi mulupingika pabehi na Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Pavayendili kwa Yesu vamuwona kasova kala, vamugojola ha mawulu, <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lakini machonda yumu amusomili na lisala mulubafu, tepu mwasi pamu na machi vamwayika. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yula yalolili figolikili pala kawomba, ili na yumwi wuwowu mjumili. Chatovilelili chiva nakaka na amanyili kucha chadetili chiva nakaka. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Findu afi fyagolikili naha ili mayandiku vavi, “Kwahela lipava daligojulewi.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Na kuna Mayandiku vengi kandi vakudeta “Davamloli mweni yivamsomili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vakumsika musembi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 27:45-56, Maliku 15:33-41, Lukasi 23:44-49</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Pambeli, Yosefu yafumili mumbwani ya Alimataya, kamuluva Pilatu kucha akuwesha kutola chikongu cha Yesu. Yosefu aveli ndundami wa Yesu, lakini amuluvili kwa lufisu kwanongwa avatilili Vayawudi. Pilatu kamuyangula ukuwesha kuutola, topi Yosefu kayenda katola chikongu. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kayenda pamu na Nikodemu, yula yayendili kwa Yesu pamihi, kayegha mtela wuvakema manimani kahasha na udi. Fyosi fyaveli kucha chitandavala chimu na litingaja. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Veni vawutola mvili wa Yesu, vawufwalisha ligubiku na kushagha vala mafuta va kunungilila kucha chishovi cha Vayawudi pavasika. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Bahala pala pavamvangililili mulupingika mbaka kasova paveli na chiwunga na musembi ya ligangachuma yivasonguliwili kala, yingajila kusikiwa mundu. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mula vawusika mvili wa Yesu, kucha mayandiku va Vayawudi, nongwa yila sembi yaveli pabehi.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kushukuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 28:1-8, Maliku 16:1-8, Lukasi 24:1-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lijuva lya kupumulila lya kwaa lya juma, Maliya Magadalena putiputi kayenda kusembi, kaliwona ligangachuma liwushiwa pa sembi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Katuva mbilu kuyenda kwa Simoni Petili na ndundami yula Yesu amutamili, kavadetela, “Vamtola Bambu kufuma musembi. Tumanya ng'odu kuvamvikili!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Petili pamu na ndundami yula vayenda kusembi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Vosi vavili vatuva mbilu, yula ndundami katuva mbilu nendu ya Petili. Kava wa kwaa kufika pa sembi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pagondamili kushungulila kasiwona yingwa siva pamu, lakini kayingila ng'odu musembi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pambeli kayisa Simoni Petili, kayingila musembi. Kasiwona yingwa shaveli pala, <verse number="7" style="v"/>na chila chipandi cha yingwa chivamuwopilili Yesu kumutwi, chaveli chiyifufunga weka yaki pambali. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pambeli yula ndundami wa kwaa kufika pala na mweni kayingila musembi. Mweni kalola kandi kajumila. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Vamanyili ng'odu mayandiku yivawombili mweni dashukuki kufuma munjifwa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pambeli vandundami vala vawuya kaya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kayilangusha kwa Maliya Magadalena</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 28:9-10, Maliku 16:9-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Maliya kawoloka kunu palila pala pasembi kunu kagondama pakashungulila musembi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kavawona makungu vavili vafwala yingwa sing'alili, vayikala pala pawonjili Yesu, yumu aveli kumutwi na yumonga aveli kumawulu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Veni vamudasha, “Mawu, ukulilila liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">Kavayangula, “Vamuwusha Bambu wangu. Nenga manya ng'odu kuvamvikili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pambeli kalola kumbali kamuwona Yesu kawoloka pala pambali, amanyili ng'odu kucha yula Yesu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Mau, wuli ukulila? Ukumusaka ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Mau yula awombeyi yula mkola chitava chila. Kamuwombela, “Mani kumutola yuwi, ung'ombeli kumuvikili na nenga ndimuloli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Maliya!” Mweni kaghalambuka kamuwombela Chibulaniya, “Laboni” Mana yaki, muwula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Ukotoo kungamula. Nongwa ngalihela kuwuya kwa Tati wangu. Ponopa yendi kwa valongu vangu kavawombeli nguwuya kwa mweni Tati wa yumwi. Kwa Chapanga wa nenga na vayumwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Maliya Magadalena kayenda kwa vandundami va Yesu, kavawombela, ndimuwona Bambu, na kamuwombela fila fyawombiliwili.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvafumbukila vandundami</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 28:16-20, Maliku 16:14-18, Lukasi 24:36-49</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yaveli mbungamihi lijuva lya kupumulila na vandundami vayikungasha pamu milyangu yitatwa, vavatileyi Vayawudi, Yesu kayisa kawoloka pavaveli veni kawomba, “Kusika kuvi na yumwi.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pawombili naha, kavalangusha mawoku vaki na lubafu lwaki. Vandundami ndavava na cheleli buja pavamuwonili Bambu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kandi Yesu kawomba, “Kusika kuvi na yumwi! Kucha Tati anyeghili nenga, ponopa nguvalayisha yumwi.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pambeli kavapumulila Mfuki Mng'alili pawomba, “Mumuyangi Yang'alili. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mani pamuvawushila vandu sambi, ava vawushilwa, pamuvawushila ng'odu, ava vawushilwa ha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Tomasi yivamkema mambila pamu na vala lilongu na vavili aveli pamu na vamonga ha Yesu payisili. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Vala vanachuli vamonga vamuwombela, “Tumuwona Bambu.” Tomasi kavawombela, “Pandiyiwona ng'odu milanga ya misumali mumawoku vaki na kugufya chala changu mumikovi yaki na kusanjika liwoku lyangu mulubafu lwaki, ngujumila ha.” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Pambeli payipitili juma yimu, vandundami vaki vaveli kandi munyumba pamu na Tomasi, kayisa kunu milyangu yitatiwa Yesu kawoloka pagati kawomba, “Kusika kuvi na yumwi” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kamuwombela Tomasi, “Yeghi chala chaku tayi na uloli mawoku vangu, uyeghi na liwoku lyaku yingishi mulubafu lwangu. Ukotoo kuyipwelesha jumili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Tomasi kamuyangula, “Bambu na Chapanga wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela kandi, “Kwa nogwa kung'ona ukujumila. Luseku kwa vala yivajumila ngajila kung'ona nenga!”</para>
  <para style="s">Mana ya chitabu achi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu kagola filangushilu fitangalili kwa vandundami vaki, yeni yiyandikiwa ha muchitabu achi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ayi yiyandikwa yumwi muweshi kujumila, kucha Yesu mweni Kilistu, mwana wa Chapanga, wula pamumjumila mweni damuvi na unofu kwa mweni.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvafumbukila vandundami saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kawoneka kandi kwa vandundami vaki kulihiva lya Tibeliya. Yaveli naha: <verse number="2" style="v"/>Simoni Petili na Tomasi yiva mkema mambila na Natanieli yula yafumili Kana ya Galilaya na vana vavili va Sebidayu na vandundami vavili va Yesu vaveli pamu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Simoni Petili kavawombela, “Nguyenda kulova vasomba.”</para>
  <para style="p">Veni vawomba, “Yufwi datuyendi na yuwi.” Vayenda vayipaka muwatu, lakini pamihi posi vapata hata somba yumu ha. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pamalavila lijuva palisosomokeyi, Yesu aveli muluwongu lwa lihiva, vandundami vamumanyili ha kucha ndi Yesu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavadasha, “Vaghanja vangu muwomesha ng'odu hata somba yumu?” Vamuyangula, “Tupata ha.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kavawombela, “Muyashi lwafu mwambu wa mulilu wa watu, damuvapati vasomba.” Vategha, pambeli valemwa kukweghela lwafu muwatu, nongwa vawomeshili vasomba vatangalili. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pambeli ndundami yula yatamiwili na Yesu kamuwombela Petili, “Yula ndi Bambu!” Simoni Petili papikanishili kucha yula ndi Bambu, kakuna yingwa yaki kayiwopela muchiwunu. Nongwa asighalili na sawu hela kayiyasila mumachi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Vandundami vasighalili muwatu vayisa kumwambu ya lihiva, kunu pavakweya lwafu lumemili vasomba. Vaveli patali ha na luwongu, paveli kucha mawulu milongu lilongu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pavafikili muluwongu, vawona motu wa makala, pambindi vavika vasomba pamu na mibumunda. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Muyeyi vasomba vamu yimuvakamulili ponopa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Simoni Petili kayipaka muwatu kakwegha lwafu luveli na vasomba mbwaya milongu na lilongu muhanu na vatatu. Vasomba vosi ava lakini lwafu lwademukili ha. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Mwisi mulyi.” Kwahela ndundami yamudashili kucha, mweni ghani, kwanongwa vamanyili mweni Bambu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu katola libumunda kavagayila, pambeli atolili vasomba kagola nga wuwula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Awu waveli mwanja wa tatu wa Yesu kuvafumbukila vandundami vaki kufuma pashukukili.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Petili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pavalili kala, Yesu kamuwombela Simoni Petili, “Simoni mwana wa Yohani, Wuli, yuwi ukundama nenga munu kupita voseva?”</para>
  <para style="p">Kamyangula, “Yina Bambu, yuwi kumanya kucha ngukutama.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamuwombela, “Dimi vanafungami vangu.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela kandi, “Simoni mwana wa Yohani, wuli, kundama?”</para>
  <para style="p">Kamuyangula, “Yina Bambu, yuwi kumanya kucha ngukutama.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamuwombela, “Dimi vafungami vangu.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mwanja wa tatu kamuwombela, “Simoni mwana wa Yohani, ukundama nenga?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petili kakalala nongwa kamdasha myanja mitatu, “Yuwi ukundama nenga?”</para>
  <para style="p">Mweni kamuwombela, “Bambu kumanya.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawomba, “Dimi vafungami vangu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ngukuwombela nakaka, pawuveyi msongolu wayiwopili umweni yingwa yaku, wayendili kuwudayila umweni. Lakini paugogola dawuhololi mawoku vaku na mundu wingi akukuwopa yingwa yaku, pambeli akukuyegha kuungajila kudayila kuyenda.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kawomba naha kulangusha kucha Petili dasovi munjifwa ya wuliwuli na kuyegha ukomi kwa Chapanga. Pambeli Yesu kamuwombela, “Ungovikeli!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na yula ndundami yumonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Petili kaghalambuka kamuwona ndumindumi yula yatamiwili na Yesu akuvakovikela, ndundami yula ndi mweni yamusaghamilili Yesu pavalyeyi, yula amudashili, “Bambu ghani akwisa akushengeti yuwi?” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Petili pamuwonili mweni, kamudasha Yesu, “Wuli mundu ayu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu kamyangula, “Leki ngudayila mweni ayikali mbaka panyisa, achi chindu liki kwa yuwi? Yuwi ungovekeli nenga.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Chilongu chila chilanduka kwa valongu kucha ndundami yula dasovi ha. Lakini Yesu kawomba ha kucha yula ndundami dasovi ng'odu, mweni kawomba kucha “Mani ngudayila mweni ayikali mbaka panyisa, achi chindu liki kwa yuwi?” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yula ndundami ndi mweni yadetili na kuyandika milandu ayi. Tumanya kucha chatovilelili chavelili nakaka.</para>
  <para style="s">Upelelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kuna milandu yitangalili Yesu yagolili. Leki fingayandikiwili fyosi chimu chimu, nguyihola mlima wosi wungaveli kwahela fwasi ya kuvika fitabu.</para>
</usx>
